WEBVTT

00:56.146 --> 00:57.854
Long live Bata Bhai!

00:57.855 --> 01:01.396
Long live Bata Bhai!

01:01.855 --> 01:03.980
- Kids!
- Long live Bata Bhai!

01:04.271 --> 01:09.313
You've been sitting here
for quite a while now.

01:10.063 --> 01:14.730
Swami Bata Bhai salutes you.

01:19.605 --> 01:21.646
So, what's today's chapter?

01:22.355 --> 01:23.354
Disease.

01:23.355 --> 01:24.896
I understand

01:26.105 --> 01:29.188
what you guys are trying to ask.

01:29.938 --> 01:32.646
Till now, we've seen plenty of diseases

01:33.355 --> 01:37.313
that our white-coat doctor buddies
have cured.

01:38.021 --> 01:40.271
But there's one disease

01:40.688 --> 01:43.813
for which we've never found a cure.

01:44.605 --> 01:48.688
And that disease is greed.

01:48.813 --> 01:50.105
Hey, buddy!

01:50.355 --> 01:53.770
Why are you making us rack our brains?

01:53.771 --> 01:57.021
Everyone's come here
to watch <i>Dhamaal</i> and have some fun.

01:57.605 --> 01:59.729
Once they watch <i>Dhamaal,</i>

01:59.730 --> 02:02.854
they'll learn everything there is
to know about greed.

02:02.855 --> 02:05.730
Kids, let me tell you something.

02:06.188 --> 02:09.438
This story is also about
some greedy people,

02:09.980 --> 02:13.730
and it began a hundred years ago.

02:14.605 --> 02:16.730
On a dark, stormy night,

02:17.063 --> 02:19.188
<i>right in the middle of the sea,</i>

02:19.355 --> 02:22.605
<i>a sea pirate named Shaitaan Singh,</i>

02:22.980 --> 02:25.105
<i>in one massive action sequence,</i>

02:25.355 --> 02:29.188
<i>beat up and killed dozens of Englishmen.</i>

02:29.438 --> 02:33.730
<i>And then, he looted the treasure
of those greedy Englishmen.</i>

02:34.355 --> 02:37.520
<i>He hid the treasure on an island</i>

02:37.521 --> 02:40.813
<i>and drew up a map to it.</i>

02:41.438 --> 02:43.938
<i>The Englishmen managed
to kill Shaitaan Singh,</i>

02:44.605 --> 02:47.271
but they never found that map.

02:47.813 --> 02:50.313
Since then, to this day,

02:50.730 --> 02:53.355
the map to that treasure
has been searched for

02:53.605 --> 02:57.396
by all kinds of greedy crooks
and cheaters.

03:19.605 --> 03:20.521
Jheenga…

03:21.605 --> 03:23.230
I can't see anything.

03:24.021 --> 03:26.063
Boss, remove the lid.

03:29.105 --> 03:30.021
The lid.

03:34.230 --> 03:36.396
He's such a dimwit.

03:39.438 --> 03:41.688
I still can't see anything, Jheenga.

03:42.438 --> 03:43.313
Hey, dumbo!

03:43.938 --> 03:44.813
I mean the lid.

03:45.271 --> 03:46.605
Remove the binocular's lid.

03:46.730 --> 03:47.646
The lid.

03:52.021 --> 03:52.896
Yes, now see.

04:00.938 --> 04:02.895
- Leave me.
- Come on. We won't leave you.

04:02.896 --> 04:03.896
We will break your bones now.

04:10.271 --> 04:11.480
Finally, you're found.

04:12.271 --> 04:14.688
Now, tell me where the treasure map is?

04:15.021 --> 04:15.896
I won't tell you.

04:18.480 --> 04:19.355
Search him.

04:25.355 --> 04:27.063
Boss, he has a gun.

04:27.438 --> 04:30.188
If he has a gun,
he must have the map, too.

04:30.396 --> 04:31.938
Check again. Come on.

04:38.896 --> 04:39.771
- Boss!
- What?

04:40.021 --> 04:43.480
Your girlfriend Shabnam's photo
is in his wallet.

04:47.105 --> 04:47.980
Shabbo?!

04:48.605 --> 04:49.855
My Shabbo's photo…

04:51.605 --> 04:52.605
How did you get it?

04:53.146 --> 04:54.021
Hey!

04:54.438 --> 04:57.271
Who else has
my Shabbo's photo?

04:59.313 --> 05:00.813
Tell me, who else has it?

05:01.771 --> 05:02.855
Who has her photo?

05:12.521 --> 05:14.646
Who else has my Shabbo…

05:20.355 --> 05:22.230
I will deal with you all later.

05:22.688 --> 05:23.563
Prithvi!

05:24.480 --> 05:25.646
I won't spare you now.

05:26.271 --> 05:27.229
Boss!

05:27.230 --> 05:29.187
Snatch away the map first
and then kill him.

05:29.188 --> 05:30.604
- Yeah.
- Hey, search him.

05:30.605 --> 05:31.562
Hey…

05:31.563 --> 05:33.229
- Come here.
- Leave me.

05:33.230 --> 05:34.105
Check properly.

05:35.480 --> 05:37.271
- Boss, here's the map.
- Hey…

05:37.438 --> 05:41.438
Boss, presenting to you
the treasure map.

05:42.271 --> 05:44.271
Hey, found it.

05:45.521 --> 05:50.230
Found the treasure map…

05:51.688 --> 05:54.604
Hey, I've found the treasure map.

05:54.605 --> 05:56.980
- Return that map.
- Hey! Back off!

05:58.563 --> 06:01.312
To get this map, my heart was…

06:01.313 --> 06:02.520
Fire! Fire!

06:02.521 --> 06:06.646
Yes, my heart was burning
with a fire no one could put out.

06:06.855 --> 06:09.062
Idiot! Is he mentally unstable?

06:09.063 --> 06:09.980
Since birth!

06:10.271 --> 06:12.437
Boss, we need to put out this fire.

06:12.438 --> 06:15.395
And who are you to put out my fire?

06:15.396 --> 06:16.396
No one can extinguish this fire…

06:17.355 --> 06:18.230
Fire!

06:24.063 --> 06:26.188
My map got burnt because of you.

06:26.563 --> 06:27.604
I won't spare you.

06:27.605 --> 06:29.105
Hey, half-brain!

06:29.896 --> 06:30.980
You can't kill me.

06:31.396 --> 06:32.938
Because the map
is stored in my memory.

06:33.313 --> 06:35.896
And I won't… share it with you.

06:36.146 --> 06:37.271
Then I will also…

06:39.146 --> 06:40.271
torture you.

06:44.521 --> 06:45.396
Did you feel the pain?

06:45.855 --> 06:48.230
Yes, sir.

07:01.146 --> 07:03.730
There comes my friend.

07:09.563 --> 07:12.355
There goes your friend.

07:14.188 --> 07:15.188
Fire!

07:16.646 --> 07:18.188
He shouldn't be spared.

07:18.521 --> 07:19.396
Don't leave him.

07:19.938 --> 07:20.938
Kill him.

07:21.396 --> 07:22.271
Yes!

07:22.563 --> 07:26.146
Hey, blind fellow, aim with this eye.
Where's he?

07:55.355 --> 07:57.812
I knew you would come to rescue me.

07:57.813 --> 07:58.813
I didn't come here to rescue you.

07:59.146 --> 08:00.188
I came to punish you.

08:00.855 --> 08:03.646
Idiot, I gave you the map to decode,

08:03.896 --> 08:06.479
but your greed got the better of you,
and you double-crossed me and ran away?

08:06.480 --> 08:09.063
But bro,
I'm the one who called you here.

08:09.396 --> 08:11.355
You called me
because you sensed danger.

08:11.980 --> 08:14.438
Don't touch my family jewel.

08:14.605 --> 08:15.562
Where's the map?

08:15.563 --> 08:16.520
It got burned.

08:16.521 --> 08:17.771
- What?!
- Don't worry.

08:17.938 --> 08:20.312
The whole map is stored in my memory.
I will share every detail with you.

08:20.313 --> 08:22.771
But first, find a way
to get us out of here, bro.

08:22.938 --> 08:26.770
I'm begging you. Please,
get me out of this place safely.

08:26.771 --> 08:27.646
- Boss.
- Yes.

08:27.813 --> 08:28.688
He's there.

08:29.146 --> 08:30.563
Hey, catch them.

08:30.813 --> 08:32.021
- Hey.
- Catch them.

08:32.563 --> 08:33.480
Make sure they don't run away.

08:33.938 --> 08:35.521
Leave me.

08:38.980 --> 08:39.896
Hey!

08:40.188 --> 08:41.646
Nobody interferes.

08:42.521 --> 08:44.271
He's my prey.

08:44.521 --> 08:45.480
Okay, boss.

08:46.105 --> 08:50.313
I'll blow up your head with my gun.

08:58.563 --> 08:59.438
Leave him.

09:08.355 --> 09:10.063
Boss! Careful!

09:12.355 --> 09:14.729
Remember what your boss said?
Nobody interferes.

09:14.730 --> 09:15.938
I'm the boss.

09:16.355 --> 09:17.355
I cancel my own order.

09:17.480 --> 09:18.479
Beat him up.

09:18.480 --> 09:19.355
Hit him!

09:21.438 --> 09:23.230
Leave… leave me.

09:23.813 --> 09:25.480
Leave me. Leave me.

09:25.855 --> 09:28.770
- Hey, blow air.
- Where?

09:28.771 --> 09:30.105
In my eyes!

09:30.313 --> 09:31.188
I'm doing it.

09:52.855 --> 09:54.604
Take out your knife, come on.

09:54.605 --> 09:57.063
Come on, aim.
Aim at him.

09:57.230 --> 09:58.438
Aim for his chest.

10:04.896 --> 10:05.771
Jheenga!

10:05.980 --> 10:06.938
- Jheenga!
- Yes.

10:07.230 --> 10:09.063
- Look at that pink pigeon.
- Where?

10:12.771 --> 10:13.646
You tricked me.

10:16.771 --> 10:17.646
Eyepatch!

10:20.105 --> 10:22.395
- Now, have fun.
- Coconut.

10:22.396 --> 10:23.354
Boss, pull it out.

10:23.355 --> 10:25.104
Yes, I will.
I can't stand the sight of blood.

10:25.105 --> 10:26.062
Wait a second.

10:26.063 --> 10:26.938
It's out!

10:54.230 --> 10:55.105
Hold me.

10:59.396 --> 11:00.271
What a relief!

11:02.938 --> 11:05.813
- Bye!
- Hey!

11:14.230 --> 11:16.313
Cannon. Cannon.
Stop limping and run.

11:18.688 --> 11:20.771
Hey, idiot!
Load it into the cannon.

11:23.521 --> 11:25.355
- Light it!
- What to light?

11:25.480 --> 11:26.480
Light the fuse.

11:30.480 --> 11:32.688
Sorry, Guddu!

11:33.438 --> 11:36.229
- Yes, turn it to the center. Center.
- Hit him.

11:36.230 --> 11:38.062
Left… left! Fire!

11:38.063 --> 11:39.230
Make sure to blow him into pieces.

11:45.063 --> 11:47.021
Boss, the cannonball is going upward.

11:58.313 --> 12:00.271
Boss, it's coming back down.

12:07.521 --> 12:08.396
It's hot.

12:09.396 --> 12:10.271
It's hot.

12:23.896 --> 12:27.105
This will explode. We will die.

12:30.771 --> 12:31.688
A cannonball…

12:59.355 --> 13:00.355
<i>It's missing.</i>

13:00.605 --> 13:01.854
<i>Who's missing?</i>

13:01.855 --> 13:03.604
<i>The "H" is missing.</i>

13:03.605 --> 13:05.105
<i>Oh. Sorry, bro.</i>

13:06.063 --> 13:07.188
<i>Here comes the "H".</i>

13:08.730 --> 13:10.562
<i>Not there.
Place it after "D".</i>

13:10.563 --> 13:11.605
<i>Sorry again.</i>

13:11.980 --> 13:13.396
<i>I'll fix it right away.</i>

13:14.230 --> 13:15.605
<i>Here comes the "H".</i>

13:46.480 --> 13:51.021
Bro. Sorry to inform you
that you're no longer alive.

13:51.230 --> 13:52.771
Rest in peace.

13:55.855 --> 13:56.813
Put that to your ear?

13:57.021 --> 13:59.480
You've already slapped me.
Still, if you insist…

14:01.438 --> 14:03.021
I told you to put this to your ear,
the stethoscope.

14:03.188 --> 14:05.229
That's not necessary.
I have good news for you.

14:05.230 --> 14:07.688
You're alive.

14:08.021 --> 14:09.980
No. I want Prithvi.

14:10.355 --> 14:11.438
I want the secret of the treasure.

14:11.730 --> 14:12.730
Until then,
there's no good news for me.

14:12.855 --> 14:14.937
No, listen. I've sent Mannu Makoda

14:14.938 --> 14:17.605
to Prithvi's house at Chamboli Ghat.

14:17.813 --> 14:21.021
He will come there to meet his girlfriend,
and we will grab him there.

14:22.188 --> 14:25.105
- I want Prithvi.
- Bro, blood pressure…

14:25.313 --> 14:27.270
- I want Prithvi.
- Your blood pressure…

14:27.271 --> 14:32.021
- I want Prithvi.
- Bro. Your blood pressure is shooting up.

14:40.021 --> 14:43.396
Bro, I'm such an amazing doctor.
It's getting under control now.

14:55.063 --> 14:58.521
Oh… here comes his ICU.

15:11.688 --> 15:12.605
Guddu!

15:13.730 --> 15:14.605
What happened to you?

15:15.396 --> 15:17.021
The same thing that happens every
time I see you.

15:20.063 --> 15:22.313
After seeing you,
I can't notice anything else at all.

15:24.396 --> 15:25.354
Okay, listen.

15:25.355 --> 15:26.646
I've already spoken with the kids.

15:27.063 --> 15:29.021
Come and meet them in the evening.

15:29.438 --> 15:30.938
If the kids like you,

15:31.271 --> 15:32.605
then our family will be complete.

15:33.188 --> 15:35.855
If I've already won the mother,
then the kids are…

15:36.855 --> 15:37.730
What?

15:38.646 --> 15:40.146
I'll win them, too.

15:47.813 --> 15:48.896
Hey, Lord Krishna!

15:49.396 --> 15:50.313
Goddess Radha!

15:50.605 --> 15:52.187
Always have Your blessings on me.

15:52.188 --> 15:53.604
DONATION BOX

15:53.605 --> 15:54.480
God,

15:55.271 --> 15:58.271
You already know that I'm not
the greedy type of person.

15:58.771 --> 15:59.980
Anyway, what more do I even want?

16:00.396 --> 16:01.271
What do I want?

16:01.605 --> 16:03.688
Just a beautiful girl,

16:04.355 --> 16:07.230
whose father owns
an extra-large bungalow,

16:07.938 --> 16:10.438
an extra-large car,

16:11.146 --> 16:14.021
an extra-large bank balance.

16:14.480 --> 16:17.188
And after marriage,
all of that should simply become mine!

16:17.521 --> 16:18.938
That's all I want.

16:20.605 --> 16:21.521
And for that,

16:21.771 --> 16:24.730
I'll offer five lakh rupees as
a donation to You, God.

16:25.063 --> 16:27.730
And yes, I've even brought
an advance payment.

16:28.896 --> 16:31.271
Fifty whole rupees from me.

16:31.396 --> 16:32.605
You'll definitely remember me for this!

16:47.021 --> 16:47.896
God!

16:48.563 --> 16:50.855
You've accepted
the request so quickly!

16:52.480 --> 16:53.730
Do You have a 5G network?

17:04.438 --> 17:05.688
You took my "extra-large" request

17:06.271 --> 17:07.730
quite seriously.

17:10.146 --> 17:11.646
It's an extra-large car.

17:15.938 --> 17:17.980
Well, I can adjust to that much.

17:18.521 --> 17:21.021
But God, You should also adjust a little.

17:21.438 --> 17:25.438
I'll pay this 50 rupees along
with the full and final payment.

17:32.105 --> 17:33.605
Why are you getting so angry, God?

17:38.938 --> 17:42.230
Seth, when are you getting
your daughter Paro married?

17:44.105 --> 17:48.230
Seth <i>ji,</i> every father worries
about his daughter's marriage.

17:49.480 --> 17:50.396
I'm worried too.

17:51.563 --> 17:53.105
With God's grace,
she will get married very soon.

17:57.605 --> 18:00.105
Thank you for dropping me
off at the temple, Uncle.

18:00.646 --> 18:02.105
- Bye, Dad.
- Bless you, dear.

18:02.855 --> 18:03.896
Go safely.

18:55.313 --> 18:57.771
Sorry. I hope you aren't hurt.

18:59.355 --> 19:00.355
Not really.

19:01.230 --> 19:02.646
But this heart did feel something.

19:02.938 --> 19:03.938
What…

19:04.813 --> 19:05.771
what's going on?

19:08.355 --> 19:09.730
Now, I'm hurt.

19:12.771 --> 19:14.063
But it's the sweet feeling.

19:16.396 --> 19:17.271
Natthu.

19:19.271 --> 19:20.396
Hey, Natthu.

19:20.896 --> 19:22.063
- Did you notice?
- Yes.

19:22.230 --> 19:24.563
I've enticed Seth's daughter.

19:25.355 --> 19:27.063
No, Lallan, he's Seth.

19:27.271 --> 19:28.771
But he's the d…

19:28.896 --> 19:31.105
No need to be afraid of anyone.

19:31.313 --> 19:33.395
When one has fallen in love,
then why fear?

19:33.396 --> 19:34.271
And take this.

19:34.521 --> 19:36.145
Distribute it to the poor on my behalf.

19:36.146 --> 19:37.021
You also take some.

19:37.313 --> 19:38.188
But…

19:39.188 --> 19:40.063
money?

19:44.813 --> 19:46.896
We were so happy on our wedding day.

19:47.313 --> 19:48.480
I love you, Rosy.

19:49.063 --> 19:51.229
Thank you for coming back into my life.

19:51.230 --> 19:52.896
Thank you.

19:59.730 --> 20:01.521
Adi, I will also play cricket.

20:04.605 --> 20:05.480
Cricket?

20:05.646 --> 20:07.688
You already took my wicket a year ago.

20:08.063 --> 20:09.688
My Rosy left me.

20:10.355 --> 20:13.730
I've been living like a widow
for the past year.

20:14.021 --> 20:16.145
It's called a widower.

20:16.146 --> 20:17.687
Be it a widower or a widow.
How does it matter?

20:17.688 --> 20:18.896
No worries.

20:19.313 --> 20:21.313
Do you remember
what you did on my wedding night?

20:21.771 --> 20:22.646
Do you?

20:23.146 --> 20:24.688
Flashback will be here and not there.

20:24.813 --> 20:25.688
Sorry.

20:51.396 --> 20:52.688
Surprise!

20:53.271 --> 20:54.480
What are you doing here?

20:54.771 --> 20:57.062
I was hiding below the bed.
To surprise <i>bhabhi.</i>

20:57.063 --> 20:58.521
Is this how you should surprise…

20:58.646 --> 20:59.646
Couldn't you come in the morning?

20:59.855 --> 21:01.437
Adi, you're not so smart.

21:01.438 --> 21:02.770
One can't declare
the surprise beforehand.

21:02.771 --> 21:04.688
- Fire! Fire!
- Take this…

21:04.938 --> 21:06.646
Fire! Fire!

21:06.855 --> 21:07.895
Adi, please put out this fire.

21:07.896 --> 21:08.771
I'm trying.

21:08.896 --> 21:10.854
Manav, bring water. Quick.

21:10.855 --> 21:11.855
Water! Water!

21:13.813 --> 21:15.730
- Adi, please do something.
- Yes, I'm doing it.

21:16.313 --> 21:17.729
Adi, water.

21:17.730 --> 21:18.938
Throw water on <i>bhabhi.</i>

21:19.230 --> 21:20.563
Manav, throw water quickly.

21:25.271 --> 21:26.395
What have you done?

21:26.396 --> 21:27.605
You told me to throw water.

21:27.813 --> 21:29.270
Should you have thrown it on her face?

21:29.271 --> 21:30.146
Look at her now.

21:36.605 --> 21:37.563
She left that day.

21:38.188 --> 21:39.271
And never returned.

21:39.480 --> 21:41.771
Adi, I am not so smart.

21:42.063 --> 21:42.938
I know.

21:44.021 --> 21:46.313
- Stop crying and listen carefully.
- Okay.

21:46.605 --> 21:48.396
I've told Rosy that my leg is fractured.

21:48.605 --> 21:49.605
She's coming to see me.

21:49.896 --> 21:52.813
I will make her so emotional

21:53.105 --> 21:54.563
that she will never leave me again.

21:54.813 --> 21:56.813
Adi, you're so smart.

21:56.938 --> 21:57.895
I know.

21:57.896 --> 21:59.813
<i>Rogue! What did you say?</i>

21:59.938 --> 22:00.895
<i>You don't keep change?</i>

22:00.896 --> 22:03.437
<i>- Bhabhi</i> is here. <i>Bhabhi</i> is here.
- Yes.

22:03.438 --> 22:05.105
<i>- Bhabhi…</i>
- You don't have the change, do you?

22:05.355 --> 22:06.604
Why don't you keep any change?

22:06.605 --> 22:08.355
- Sorry, madam.
- Get lost! I don't want your "sorry".

22:09.855 --> 22:10.855
She's such a dangerous woman.

22:11.105 --> 22:12.355
- Let's go, Manav.
- Yes.

22:12.646 --> 22:14.354
Sit there and enjoy the walnut.
Just don't do anything.

22:14.355 --> 22:15.230
Okay.

22:35.230 --> 22:36.813
Enough. Stop crying.

22:37.938 --> 22:38.855
How did this happen?

22:38.980 --> 22:42.480
I was lost in your memories
while boarding a bus.

22:43.063 --> 22:44.730
Didn't realize when the bus crushed me.

22:46.146 --> 22:47.438
Since then, I've been in bed.

22:47.938 --> 22:48.938
All alone.

22:49.396 --> 22:50.271
Lonely.

22:50.730 --> 22:51.730
Helpless.

22:52.438 --> 22:54.563
- Don't leave me alone, Rosy.
- Enough.

22:54.896 --> 22:55.771
I've come back, right?

22:56.230 --> 22:57.646
Now I will stay here with you.

22:57.938 --> 23:00.354
Thank you. Thank you, Rosy.

23:00.355 --> 23:01.355
Alright! It's okay.

23:03.021 --> 23:03.979
Stupid!

23:03.980 --> 23:04.937
Keep that weight down.

23:04.938 --> 23:05.813
Okay.

23:08.355 --> 23:09.271
Oh no!

23:14.771 --> 23:16.104
Manav, what have you done?

23:16.105 --> 23:17.604
I was trying to break the walnut.

23:17.605 --> 23:19.105
But you've hurt your <i>bhabhi</i> instead.

23:19.605 --> 23:20.938
I'm not so smart.

23:21.105 --> 23:22.271
Manav, you idiot!

23:22.855 --> 23:23.812
<i>Bhabhi!</i>

23:23.813 --> 23:24.895
- Manav…
- Give this to me.

23:24.896 --> 23:25.771
Walnut! Walnut!

23:25.938 --> 23:26.895
Manav!

23:26.896 --> 23:28.605
- Leave it!
- This walnut.

23:31.938 --> 23:32.813
My walnut!

23:34.938 --> 23:36.062
Adi, it fell.

23:36.063 --> 23:37.771
It fell?! She fell!

23:37.938 --> 23:40.062
No, I mean the walnut fell.

23:40.063 --> 23:41.480
To hell with your walnut.

23:41.730 --> 23:43.396
Pull your <i>bhabhi</i> up. Come on.

23:44.063 --> 23:46.063
Yes! Yes!
<i>Bhabhi,</i> don't worry.

23:46.355 --> 23:47.230
Be happy!

23:47.480 --> 23:49.146
- Adi! Adi, what should I do?
- Pull up.

23:51.480 --> 23:52.688
Down! Down!

23:53.188 --> 23:54.396
Oh no!

23:57.230 --> 23:59.104
<i>Bhabhi.</i> Don't worry.

23:59.105 --> 24:00.313
What are you doing?

24:00.563 --> 24:01.979
Are you pulling water from the well?

24:01.980 --> 24:04.188
- Pull your <i>bhabhi</i> up. Come on.
- Manav!

24:06.105 --> 24:07.146
<i>Bhabhi,</i> don't worry.

24:22.480 --> 24:24.354
Oh no. <i>Bhabhi!</i>

24:24.355 --> 24:26.312
<i>- Bhabhi! Bhabhi!</i>
- Pull me up.

24:26.313 --> 24:27.729
- Don't worry.
- What are you doing?

24:27.730 --> 24:28.605
Hey, you!

24:30.188 --> 24:31.187
Keep it up, <i>bhabhi.</i>

24:31.188 --> 24:32.271
Yes. Very good.

24:36.021 --> 24:38.855
<i>- Bhabhi!</i> Are you alright, <i>bhabhi?</i>
- Are you fine?

24:39.355 --> 24:40.230
- Are you alright?
- Are you alright?

24:41.313 --> 24:42.896
How are you standing on your feet?

24:44.730 --> 24:46.105
It's a miracle!

24:46.230 --> 24:48.062
- It's a miracle!
- Miracle!

24:48.063 --> 24:50.063
- It's a miracle!
- It's a miracle!

24:50.230 --> 24:52.937
- Praise the Lord! Hallelujah!
- Hallelujah!

24:52.938 --> 24:54.105
- Adi!
- What happened?

24:55.021 --> 24:56.145
Which of your legs was broken?

24:56.146 --> 24:57.229
The right leg, <i>bhabhi.</i>

24:57.230 --> 24:58.396
- The right leg.
- Okay.

24:58.646 --> 25:00.729
And the plaster is there.
It's really…

25:00.730 --> 25:01.605
What are you doing?

25:03.063 --> 25:03.980
Shit! Shit!

25:08.646 --> 25:09.521
What happened?

25:20.021 --> 25:20.896
This is the one, bro?

25:21.521 --> 25:22.396
Press the bell.

25:42.896 --> 25:43.938
Bro!

25:52.855 --> 25:53.771
Bro!

25:56.146 --> 25:57.188
Automatic!

26:20.563 --> 26:21.980
- Bro…
- Yeah.

26:23.230 --> 26:24.688
Are you sure this
is <i>bhabhi's</i> house?

26:26.355 --> 26:28.355
Don't know.
I've also come here for the first time.

26:29.521 --> 26:30.396
Aaliya!

26:32.521 --> 26:34.646
Bro, I can't see anything.

26:34.771 --> 26:36.312
- Electricity went off, man.
- Okay.

26:36.313 --> 26:37.188
Aaliya!

26:37.771 --> 26:38.646
Aaliya!

26:39.188 --> 26:40.105
Aaliya…

26:42.188 --> 26:43.230
Hey, open the door.

26:43.730 --> 26:45.812
Somebody, please, open the door.

26:45.813 --> 26:47.645
But who closed the door?

26:47.646 --> 26:49.688
The one who opened it
must have closed it.

26:50.271 --> 26:51.438
Don't scare me, bro.

26:54.688 --> 26:55.563
Aaliya!

26:56.938 --> 26:57.813
Aaila!

26:58.855 --> 26:59.812
Aaila!

26:59.813 --> 27:00.980
Who's this Aaila, bro?

27:01.105 --> 27:03.355
- It's Aaliya.
- Yes, yes. Aaliya.

27:03.563 --> 27:04.520
Aaliya <i>bhabhi!</i>

27:04.521 --> 27:05.855
Aaliya!

27:06.146 --> 27:07.396
- Aaliya <i>bhabhi!</i>
- Bro!

27:08.521 --> 27:09.438
Bro!

27:34.271 --> 27:35.146
Bro, no.

27:37.396 --> 27:38.271
No, bro.

27:55.271 --> 27:56.146
Bro!

28:00.188 --> 28:01.938
Are you sure this is <i>bhabhi's</i> house?

28:19.646 --> 28:21.980
Bro, underwear ghost.

28:25.521 --> 28:26.438
Not "underwear" ghost.

28:27.480 --> 28:28.729
It's an undercover ghost.

28:28.730 --> 28:30.021
Yes, exactly.

28:57.938 --> 28:58.938
Are you tired?

29:00.021 --> 29:01.771
Want some tea, brother?

29:02.605 --> 29:06.396
Less sugar, along
with some biscuits, sister.

29:07.021 --> 29:07.938
Right, bro?

29:08.688 --> 29:13.021
- Hey, run! Run!
- Run! Run!

29:13.605 --> 29:17.438
- Aaliya! Aaliya!
- Open the door, please.

29:18.146 --> 29:20.188
Anyone here?

29:20.771 --> 29:25.146
- Open the door! Open the door!
- Please, help us!

29:25.605 --> 29:27.063
Open the door!

29:27.438 --> 29:28.938
Hey…

29:32.813 --> 29:33.770
What happened, bro?

29:33.771 --> 29:35.396
Did you find the way out?

29:37.188 --> 29:38.730
We are done for real.

29:53.063 --> 29:54.230
Let us go.

29:56.438 --> 30:00.438
She's the Burj Khalifa of ghosts.

30:00.980 --> 30:04.396
You wanted to have some tea.
Right, bro?

30:05.105 --> 30:08.605
Elder sister is coming
with the biscuits.

30:12.771 --> 30:16.105
No. No, biscuits. Bread will do.

30:23.730 --> 30:25.980
Sister, you got long hands.

30:26.188 --> 30:27.688
Please, open the latch.

30:47.480 --> 30:48.355
Bro.

30:48.646 --> 30:50.062
She has a hearing problem.

30:50.063 --> 30:53.271
I told her to open the lock,
but she has handed over her head.

30:58.271 --> 31:01.146
No! Run, run, run, run!

31:02.355 --> 31:04.563
Here you go.
Have some tea and biscuits.

31:05.438 --> 31:06.688
Take it, brother.

31:07.396 --> 31:08.271
Take it.

31:08.521 --> 31:09.730
Okay, sister.

31:10.063 --> 31:10.938
Take it.

31:11.521 --> 31:12.562
Run!

31:12.563 --> 31:14.145
- Tea and biscuits.
- Sorry…

31:14.146 --> 31:16.480
- Let's run away.
- Bro…

31:16.688 --> 31:19.937
- Come on, bro!
- Run! Quick!

31:19.938 --> 31:21.312
- Run…
- Bro, come fast.

31:21.313 --> 31:23.063
We will jump from the terrace. Run, bro!

31:26.563 --> 31:27.521
Bro!

31:33.771 --> 31:35.813
Bro! Bro! Bro!

31:40.146 --> 31:41.355
- Ghost!
- Ghost!

31:42.271 --> 31:43.896
- Ghost!
- Ghost!

31:44.896 --> 31:46.021
- Aaliya!
- Guddu?!

31:46.188 --> 31:47.145
There's a ghost in this house.

31:47.146 --> 31:50.312
Yes! The ghost that serves tea
and sweeps the floor.

31:50.313 --> 31:51.896
You guys are looking like ghosts.

31:54.063 --> 31:55.646
No. There's a ghost in this house.

31:56.021 --> 31:58.438
No one is here except
Gangubai and my kids.

31:58.771 --> 31:59.646
Didn't they meet you?

32:02.230 --> 32:03.105
Kids.

32:05.188 --> 32:06.438
Hide it. Hurry up.

32:07.021 --> 32:07.896
Kids?

32:08.563 --> 32:10.646
- Hurry up, kids. Your mom is calling you.
- Yes.

32:20.646 --> 32:23.771
Dad, whether it's Guddu or anyone else,

32:24.771 --> 32:26.230
no one can ever replace you.

32:27.063 --> 32:27.938
No one.

32:29.396 --> 32:31.855
Go freshen up.
I'll send the kids to you.

32:32.438 --> 32:35.688
But remember,
you've got to impress them, okay?

32:37.146 --> 32:38.021
Kids!

32:39.146 --> 32:40.855
- Namaste!
- Namaste!

32:41.021 --> 32:44.271
Bro… they're so well-behaved!

32:45.855 --> 32:46.855
Not well-behaved.

32:47.813 --> 32:49.021
These kids are a menace.

32:50.146 --> 32:51.938
They had set up the horror treatment.

32:52.521 --> 32:53.396
Really?

32:54.813 --> 32:55.688
Aren't you ashamed?

32:56.230 --> 32:58.396
You turned your soon-to-be pop
into popcorn?

33:00.813 --> 33:03.938
But why did you do
this surgical strike on us?

33:04.230 --> 33:07.270
Because a third-class person like you,
who deals in second-class things,

33:07.271 --> 33:09.813
can never be a part of
our first-class mother's life.

33:10.063 --> 33:12.479
You can never replace
our dad in our lives.

33:12.480 --> 33:13.355
Never.

33:18.313 --> 33:20.230
Your dad's place is up there on the wall.

33:20.563 --> 33:21.896
I'd never want to take that place.

33:22.313 --> 33:24.021
I'll carve out my own place in this house.

33:24.605 --> 33:25.480
Juice.

33:25.855 --> 33:28.188
Do you want to make
your own place in this house?

33:29.521 --> 33:31.396
So, shall we start discussing
your marriage with Gangubai?

33:35.771 --> 33:36.646
Hey!

33:37.105 --> 33:38.604
What am I going to do with this trash?

33:38.605 --> 33:40.813
- No way. Get lost.
- Gangu <i>ji…</i>

33:41.480 --> 33:42.855
what do you think about me?

33:43.980 --> 33:44.938
Hey, idiot!

33:45.646 --> 33:49.605
I rejected Ajay Devgn,
and you think I'd choose Sanjay Mishra?

33:50.021 --> 33:50.896
Get lost!

33:53.313 --> 33:55.105
Look, even she's not ready.

33:56.063 --> 33:57.063
Here come the snacks!

33:58.563 --> 33:59.438
Come, let's eat.

34:05.480 --> 34:07.230
- Excuse me, please.
- It's important.

34:09.188 --> 34:10.146
How's he?

34:17.355 --> 34:18.230
What?!

34:18.563 --> 34:20.021
Prithvi is coming
to Chamboli Ghat on Sunday?

34:20.355 --> 34:21.271
Is the information correct?

34:21.521 --> 34:22.396
Okay.

34:26.230 --> 34:27.146
Kids?

34:27.521 --> 34:30.646
Guddu, I think we need
to give some more time to the kids.

34:31.105 --> 34:33.438
Let's go on a bonding trip this Sunday?

34:33.563 --> 34:34.645
Sunday?!

34:34.646 --> 34:37.562
He has to go to Chamboli Ghat
on Sunday. It's important.

34:37.563 --> 34:38.855
So, let us join you guys.

34:39.188 --> 34:41.937
You can finish your work,
and we will have a bonding trip too.

34:41.938 --> 34:43.605
- But…
- Guddu, please.

34:44.105 --> 34:45.105
We have to go.

34:45.980 --> 34:46.855
Guddu!

34:47.896 --> 34:49.021
He's very kind at heart.

34:49.188 --> 34:50.063
Okay.

36:01.563 --> 36:04.646
<i>Ever since I fell in love with you</i>

36:08.730 --> 36:12.438
<i>I've started forgetting
My name and identity</i>

36:16.563 --> 36:19.646
<i>It's only you, I search for everywhere</i>

36:20.271 --> 36:23.105
<i>Restlessly, I keep circling around you</i>

36:23.438 --> 36:27.480
<i>I've lost my heart, lost myself
And left the whole world behind for you</i>

36:27.813 --> 36:30.896
<i>Your graceful walk has driven me crazy</i>

36:31.563 --> 36:34.480
<i>In the pink saree
With those rosy red cheeks</i>

36:35.313 --> 36:38.313
<i>I look breath-taking
Take my picture, dear</i>

36:39.021 --> 36:42.146
<i>You look absolutely stunning
In the pink saree</i>

36:42.771 --> 36:45.938
<i>O beauty, come take a photo with me</i>

36:48.105 --> 36:49.980
<i>Money, money, money, money</i>

36:51.855 --> 36:53.730
<i>Money, money, money, money</i>

37:00.771 --> 37:04.479
<i>My love, listen to me
I'm yearning for you</i>

37:04.480 --> 37:08.230
<i>There's a storm raging wildly
Inside my heart</i>

37:08.563 --> 37:11.895
<i>I've lost my sleep and senses
The moment you came close to me</i>

37:11.896 --> 37:15.980
<i>I wish to propose you once again</i>

37:16.230 --> 37:19.396
<i>No one in this world feels
As beautiful as you</i>

37:19.980 --> 37:23.270
<i>I want this story of ours
To go on forever</i>

37:23.271 --> 37:26.937
<i>You shine fresh and warm
Just like morning sunlight</i>

37:26.938 --> 37:30.605
<i>Come, let's take a flight
Somewhere far away</i>

37:30.730 --> 37:34.479
<i>Don't ignore me, my love</i>

37:34.480 --> 37:38.480
<i>Or else I'll die</i>

37:39.021 --> 37:42.021
<i>In the pink saree
With those rosy red cheeks</i>

37:42.813 --> 37:45.730
<i>I look breath-taking
Take my picture, dear</i>

37:46.521 --> 37:49.521
<i>You look absolutely stunning
In the pink saree</i>

37:50.271 --> 37:53.396
<i>O beauty, come take
A photo with me</i>

37:55.563 --> 37:57.480
<i>Money, money, money, money</i>

37:59.355 --> 38:01.230
<i>Money, money, money, money</i>

38:03.105 --> 38:04.980
<i>Money, money, money, money</i>

38:06.855 --> 38:08.771
<i>Money, money, money, money</i>

38:10.813 --> 38:11.896
Hey, Paro.

38:13.146 --> 38:15.730
We should get married now.

38:17.688 --> 38:21.813
For that, you need
to talk to my dad.

38:22.313 --> 38:23.188
Shut up!

38:23.313 --> 38:25.146
I know these rich people very well.

38:25.688 --> 38:28.396
We will first get married
and then meet your dad.

38:29.521 --> 38:31.105
You forgot to take this flower.

38:31.480 --> 38:34.312
Stop blushing, Paro.

38:34.313 --> 38:37.354
Lallan, she's the d…

38:37.355 --> 38:38.562
D…

38:38.563 --> 38:40.145
Keep the palanquin ready!

38:40.146 --> 38:42.313
I'm going to get married.

38:44.771 --> 38:50.730
He's going to get cheated on for sure.

38:52.896 --> 38:54.605
Bride and groom, exchange the garlands.

38:58.646 --> 38:59.646
Hurry up. Come.

39:03.896 --> 39:05.563
Bride and groom, get your picture taken.

39:06.188 --> 39:07.563
Get it clicked properly.

39:16.563 --> 39:17.438
Seth!

39:18.146 --> 39:19.188
Seth!

39:20.188 --> 39:21.646
Where are you? Come out!

39:22.188 --> 39:24.396
Look here.
Your son-in-law has come home.

39:28.646 --> 39:30.480
Come, Seth. Come.

39:40.313 --> 39:42.313
- Congratulations, Seth.
- To you, too.

39:46.896 --> 39:49.980
What are you whispering
in each other's ears?

39:50.438 --> 39:53.563
- Son, I was saying that--
- I know what you are going to say.

39:53.730 --> 39:56.230
You might want to tell me
that I should leave Paro.

39:56.938 --> 40:00.730
And in return, you will give me
a blank check. Right?

40:01.396 --> 40:03.271
No, why would I do that?

40:03.396 --> 40:05.896
So, will you give a direct bank
transfer or UPI?

40:06.230 --> 40:07.688
Or NEFT?

40:08.063 --> 40:10.479
You might have an objection
to our marriage,

40:10.480 --> 40:11.938
but let me tell you one thing.

40:12.313 --> 40:14.938
I will never leave Paro.

40:15.188 --> 40:16.105
Never.

40:18.021 --> 40:20.855
Son, no one has any objection
to your marriage.

40:21.480 --> 40:24.187
Look at Paro's dad.
He's so happy.

40:24.188 --> 40:25.063
Look at him.

40:26.730 --> 40:27.605
Dad?!

40:28.396 --> 40:29.938
- Bless you, son!
- Yes.

40:30.146 --> 40:31.521
But Paro is Seth G's daughter.

40:31.688 --> 40:32.645
Yes.

40:32.646 --> 40:33.521
And you're Seth G.

40:33.855 --> 40:35.188
Yes, I'm also Seth G.

40:36.271 --> 40:37.146
What does that mean?

40:37.271 --> 40:38.938
- I mean…
- I'm also Seth G.

40:39.563 --> 40:41.354
So, she has two fathers?

40:41.355 --> 40:42.312
No.

40:42.313 --> 40:43.521
- Both of us are Seth.
- Yes.

40:43.813 --> 40:44.770
What?

40:44.771 --> 40:46.605
- I'm Seth G.
- Okay.

40:46.771 --> 40:47.855
Seth Garibdas.

40:48.021 --> 40:48.938
The owner of this bungalow.

40:50.021 --> 40:50.979
And…

40:50.980 --> 40:52.688
I am G Seth.

40:54.021 --> 40:55.146
Gopaldas Seth.

40:55.605 --> 40:57.813
Driver of this bungalow's owner.

41:03.730 --> 41:05.480
Yes, he's my dad.

41:05.980 --> 41:06.855
Your father-in-law.

41:07.605 --> 41:09.896
- Gopal Seth, the driver.
- Yes.

41:10.771 --> 41:13.688
No!

41:18.688 --> 41:20.313
Son, what are you doing?

41:20.563 --> 41:22.271
- I'm going to kill you.
- But why?

41:22.396 --> 41:26.895
Because of people like you,
people like me lose faith in true love.

41:26.896 --> 41:27.980
No, son.

41:28.230 --> 41:29.187
Who will die first?

41:29.188 --> 41:30.771
Seth G or G Seth?

41:31.396 --> 41:32.271
Seth G!

41:32.688 --> 41:33.688
Okay, Seth G.

41:36.938 --> 41:37.938
Now, G Seth.

41:39.271 --> 41:41.105
- Dad!
- Paro!

41:44.771 --> 41:46.355
What happened to you?
Are you alright?

41:47.271 --> 41:48.146
Was it a dream?

41:50.605 --> 41:51.605
He is too excited.

41:51.771 --> 41:52.646
Yes.

41:54.230 --> 41:56.104
- Rekha, dear.
- Yes.

41:56.105 --> 41:57.396
Bring the welcome platter.

41:57.521 --> 41:58.396
Right away.

42:14.813 --> 42:16.813
Welcome the newly
married couple, dear.

42:21.688 --> 42:22.605
Who's she?

42:23.605 --> 42:25.105
She's my daughter, Rekha.

42:26.855 --> 42:28.563
- She's also of marriageable age.
- Yes.

42:30.230 --> 42:32.563
If you know any suitable guy for her,

42:32.938 --> 42:34.521
even if he's poor like you,

42:36.021 --> 42:36.980
do let me know.

42:41.355 --> 42:43.396
- Don't you go to the temple?
- No.

42:44.146 --> 42:45.355
But today I will definitely go.

42:45.938 --> 42:48.105
So that I can also get
a husband like you.

42:49.730 --> 42:50.605
Let's go, sister.

42:54.646 --> 42:55.855
Today we will cook pumpkin curry.

42:56.355 --> 42:57.312
With <i>puris.</i>

42:57.313 --> 42:58.938
- Some <i>kheer</i> as well.
- Had you come two days earlier,

42:59.605 --> 43:00.605
you would have been my wife.

43:03.521 --> 43:05.521
Such an ill-fated person I am!

43:06.980 --> 43:08.938
Lallan!

43:09.063 --> 43:11.188
I used to tell you from day one.
That she's the d…

43:12.480 --> 43:13.355
What?

43:13.771 --> 43:16.480
Today, you complete
your sentence. Come on.

43:17.021 --> 43:19.855
That's what I was telling you.
She's the d…

43:23.188 --> 43:24.063
driver's daughter!

43:24.521 --> 43:25.480
Yes.

43:26.146 --> 43:28.146
I will kill you, idiot.

43:28.396 --> 43:29.395
"Driver's daughter."

43:29.396 --> 43:31.770
Why didn't you say that earlier?
You were stuck at "d…"

43:31.771 --> 43:33.562
Couldn't you complete
the sentence once?

43:33.563 --> 43:37.063
I could have understood. But you…

43:37.521 --> 43:38.396
No…

43:39.146 --> 43:41.146
No, Lallan. No!

43:41.313 --> 43:44.146
Lallan! Lallan! No…

44:12.855 --> 44:14.938
Boss, who made your boat sink?

44:15.230 --> 44:17.646
- And what's wrong with your walk?
- Forget about my walking style.

44:18.646 --> 44:19.688
Find Prithvi.

44:20.271 --> 44:21.813
I want Prithvi.

44:22.230 --> 44:25.438
Find him from any part of the world.

44:26.438 --> 44:27.938
I want the treasure.

44:28.438 --> 44:30.812
I want the treasure! Go!

44:30.813 --> 44:31.730
Yes, boss.

44:39.980 --> 44:40.855
- Hi!
- Hi!

44:41.188 --> 44:42.063
- Hello!
- Hello!

44:42.230 --> 44:43.105
- Hi!
- Hi!

44:44.480 --> 44:45.479
Where's your bag?

44:45.480 --> 44:47.230
- I'm not coming with you.
- Why?

44:47.563 --> 44:50.562
The kids wanted to go on
a bonding trip with you alone.

44:50.563 --> 44:51.521
And I said okay.

44:52.438 --> 44:54.437
Oh no, I forgot to bring
snacks for the kids.

44:54.438 --> 44:55.438
Wait a minute. Coming.

45:05.188 --> 45:06.063
Guddu.

45:07.188 --> 45:08.063
Snacks!

45:09.646 --> 45:10.604
Snacks.

45:10.605 --> 45:11.480
- Bye. See you.
- Bye.

45:11.646 --> 45:12.895
- Bye.
- Bye. Bye.

45:12.896 --> 45:13.855
- Bye!
- Bye, Mom.

45:16.730 --> 45:18.813
Johnny, get ready fast.

45:19.021 --> 45:20.480
- I'm coming to pick you up.
<i>- Yeah, bro.</i>

45:24.563 --> 45:27.521
God, just for 50 rupees!

45:28.438 --> 45:31.563
You completely ruined my life
just for 50 rupees!

45:32.980 --> 45:34.646
You've given me such
a huge punishment.

45:35.896 --> 45:36.938
Such a huge one!

45:38.980 --> 45:43.230
Today, I managed to make her sleep
by giving her sleeping pills.

45:43.980 --> 45:48.980
But for how long will I be able
to protect my dignity?

45:49.438 --> 45:51.521
Give me another life, God!

45:52.063 --> 45:54.105
I've already ruined this life!

45:54.605 --> 45:55.605
I'm coming to you now!

45:55.855 --> 45:57.313
I'm coming to you.
I'm coming.

46:01.938 --> 46:02.813
I'm coming to you now.

46:04.021 --> 46:04.896
Right now.

46:05.105 --> 46:06.312
What are you doing, son?

46:06.313 --> 46:07.313
Suicide.

46:07.521 --> 46:09.105
Let it be. Do it later.

46:09.438 --> 46:10.313
Take this first.

46:10.563 --> 46:11.520
What's this?

46:11.521 --> 46:13.105
- A gift!
- Gift?

46:13.563 --> 46:15.021
I had bought a plot for Paro.

46:15.896 --> 46:17.105
Near Bhusawal Highway.

46:17.813 --> 46:19.021
You can transfer it to your name.

46:19.396 --> 46:20.354
At what price did you buy it?

46:20.355 --> 46:21.313
- Twenty…
- Lakh?

46:21.688 --> 46:22.938
- Thousands.
- Damn!

46:23.313 --> 46:24.980
Did you buy a plot or a music system?

46:25.396 --> 46:26.771
I'm coming, God.

46:27.771 --> 46:29.188
Son, I bought that plot
20 years ago.

46:29.855 --> 46:31.646
Its present value is approximately
50 lakh rupees.

46:35.271 --> 46:36.646
- How much?
- 50 lakh.

46:36.938 --> 46:37.813
- 50 lakh?
- Yes.

46:39.105 --> 46:39.980
Why are you doing that?

46:40.271 --> 46:42.271
- My luck has turned away from me.
- What?

46:42.438 --> 46:44.229
I consumed this rat poison.

46:44.230 --> 46:45.521
Why didn't you tell me that earlier?

46:46.063 --> 46:46.938
Stupid.

46:47.355 --> 46:49.063
Haven't you tasted
rat poison ever in your life?

46:49.646 --> 46:51.063
Can't you recognize the taste?

46:51.605 --> 46:52.480
It's rose water.

46:53.271 --> 46:54.146
Rose water?!

46:54.563 --> 46:56.480
- What kind of system is this?
- What?

46:56.605 --> 46:58.063
The rich man's name is Garibdas.

46:58.230 --> 46:59.520
- Driver's name is Seth G.
- Right.

46:59.521 --> 47:01.562
This rat poison bottle
is filled with rose water.

47:01.563 --> 47:02.937
What do you fill
the rose water bottle with?

47:02.938 --> 47:04.438
- Kerosene.
- Kerosene!

47:04.938 --> 47:05.980
What kind of a system is that?

47:06.188 --> 47:08.063
Leave that. Come with me.

47:08.271 --> 47:10.105
I've bought a three-wheeler for you.

47:10.271 --> 47:11.563
- What?
- And this is the key.

47:12.438 --> 47:13.313
There's your auto.

47:16.063 --> 47:16.938
- Auto?
- Yeah.

47:17.605 --> 47:19.105
Is this an auto-rickshaw key
or a rocket key?

47:19.730 --> 47:20.687
You fool!

47:20.688 --> 47:21.896
Rocket doesn't require any key.

47:22.146 --> 47:23.812
It only needs a matchstick.

47:23.813 --> 47:25.521
Just light it, and there you go.

47:26.271 --> 47:27.188
This is the real key.

47:28.771 --> 47:29.688
Go in the auto.

47:30.313 --> 47:32.146
Okay. You drink this.

47:35.105 --> 47:35.980
Papers.

47:38.438 --> 47:39.355
Hey, son-in-law.

47:39.980 --> 47:40.855
What's it?

47:41.021 --> 47:42.146
Take Paro along.

47:43.146 --> 47:44.771
Her thumbprint will be required
for the transfer.

47:45.438 --> 47:46.646
What if I take her thumb only?

47:48.188 --> 47:50.480
I was just joking. Hey, Paro.

47:50.688 --> 47:52.479
Wake up fast. You're fast asleep.

47:52.480 --> 47:53.980
- He's too funny.
- Wake up now.

47:54.355 --> 47:56.521
- But he takes good care of Paro.
- You're fast asleep.

48:08.146 --> 48:10.563
Three bags are kept.

48:11.146 --> 48:12.021
Whatever!

48:12.646 --> 48:13.604
Oh shit!

48:13.605 --> 48:14.563
Why won't it close?

48:15.230 --> 48:16.105
Hey!

48:16.646 --> 48:18.730
- It's not…
- Manav, what are you doing?

48:19.855 --> 48:21.563
Your <i>bhabhi</i> is half inside
and half outside.

48:24.521 --> 48:26.313
- Sorry.
- Please come.

48:26.438 --> 48:28.854
- Sorry, <i>bhabhi.</i> Sorry.
- Go, sit in the car.

48:28.855 --> 48:29.812
Okay.

48:29.813 --> 48:30.688
Are you alright?

48:31.271 --> 48:32.271
Adi, enough.

48:33.230 --> 48:35.313
You've got time till you drop me home.

48:35.688 --> 48:37.813
Before this trip ends,
you will have to decide

48:38.021 --> 48:39.188
who you want to live with.

48:39.563 --> 48:41.688
With your brother Manav or with me.

48:42.146 --> 48:44.230
Otherwise, my lawyer will see you
with the divorce papers.

48:44.771 --> 48:46.230
- Rosy, divorce…
- Let's go.

48:52.230 --> 48:53.938
Aarav, how strange!

48:54.146 --> 48:55.480
You get momo on the highway, too.

48:56.396 --> 48:58.437
Bro, because of these kids,

48:58.438 --> 48:59.605
this is the sixth time
we are having tea.

49:00.855 --> 49:01.730
Mark my words,

49:02.313 --> 49:03.938
we are not on a journey.
Rather, we are suffering.

49:04.521 --> 49:06.230
Buffering without a network.

49:06.396 --> 49:08.771
And these kids.
They made us halt a lot of times.

49:09.355 --> 49:11.855
A three-hour-long drive
has turned into a marathon.

49:13.230 --> 49:15.396
They are forced on us.

49:15.730 --> 49:17.063
- We must entertain them.
- Yeah.

49:17.646 --> 49:18.521
Kids.

49:19.563 --> 49:21.271
If you want to eat anything else,
don't hesitate.

49:22.271 --> 49:23.188
Yes!

49:23.605 --> 49:24.480
We are a family.

49:24.938 --> 49:25.896
Of course.

49:28.355 --> 49:31.771
We'll put him in such a condition
that from Monday to Sunday,

49:31.896 --> 49:33.438
he'll be scared of just one thing.

49:33.730 --> 49:34.688
Family.

49:36.313 --> 49:38.021
This fatso stuffs a lot.

49:42.313 --> 49:43.230
These days, he's dieting.

49:43.605 --> 49:44.605
- Okay.
- Anyway, leave that.

49:45.313 --> 49:46.813
I will drop you and the kids at the hotel

49:47.355 --> 49:48.480
and grab Prithvi first.

49:49.355 --> 49:51.355
Then we will deal with these kids.

49:55.146 --> 49:56.021
Prithvi!

49:56.146 --> 49:57.146
No, bro. I'm Johnny.

49:57.855 --> 49:59.146
Look there. Prithvi!

50:04.271 --> 50:05.146
Bro…

50:06.313 --> 50:07.563
- Hey, stop.
- What happened to them all of a sudden?

50:08.688 --> 50:10.354
Maybe nature's call.

50:10.355 --> 50:13.146
Hey, leave him. Leave him.

50:13.563 --> 50:15.105
- Leave!
- Leave me.

50:17.521 --> 50:18.604
Guddu, you?!

50:18.605 --> 50:19.563
I'm alive, you moron.

50:19.813 --> 50:21.021
But now, you will not be spared.

50:21.938 --> 50:24.646
Jagga, has the boss appointed a new man?

50:25.563 --> 50:26.730
Who's that?
Who's he beating up?

50:26.938 --> 50:29.145
Brother, you can beat me up later.

50:29.146 --> 50:30.438
But save me from these goons first.

50:31.980 --> 50:33.770
Come, I will break your skull.

50:33.771 --> 50:35.104
Hey, no. Don't hit me here.

50:35.105 --> 50:36.062
The map is fixed in my memory.

50:36.063 --> 50:37.063
If you hit there,
the map might get deleted.

50:45.771 --> 50:47.438
Bloody…

50:59.438 --> 51:00.313
Run!

51:12.396 --> 51:13.687
Guddu, let's quickly go away, please.

51:13.688 --> 51:14.980
- Guddu!
- Bro!

51:17.230 --> 51:19.521
Kids, for God's sake, give us the key.

51:19.688 --> 51:20.563
Please.

51:21.480 --> 51:22.355
Get lost.

51:23.188 --> 51:24.063
Get lost.

51:36.021 --> 51:38.230
Do not touch my kids.

51:41.605 --> 51:42.480
Oh no!

51:42.771 --> 51:44.855
Hey, catch those kids.

51:51.188 --> 51:52.355
Get in. Quick!

52:02.146 --> 52:03.230
Where has Prithvi gone?

52:03.813 --> 52:05.521
Boss, somebody took him away
in a car.

52:06.313 --> 52:07.188
In a car?

52:08.355 --> 52:09.355
Who took him away in a car?

52:09.688 --> 52:11.980
Boss, he must be Guddu.

52:13.730 --> 52:18.063
Guddu, that rascal. Guddu!

52:23.563 --> 52:25.938
Guddu, you wanted us
to get killed by those goons?

52:26.188 --> 52:28.980
I see. As if you wanted
to get me rewarded today.

52:29.105 --> 52:31.770
Your kids are too sweet.

52:31.771 --> 52:35.396
Forget the kids, talk to the elders.

52:35.688 --> 52:38.312
Tell me, where is
Shaitan Singh's treasure? Tell me!

52:38.313 --> 52:40.188
You said you've memorized the map.
So, tell me where it is now.

52:40.730 --> 52:41.896
Shaitan Singh's treasure?!

52:42.271 --> 52:43.438
History chapter six.

52:43.563 --> 52:44.770
The Hidden Pirate Treasure.

52:44.771 --> 52:46.687
Do you know the secret
to Shaitan Singh's treasure?

52:46.688 --> 52:47.645
Keep quiet, both of you.

52:47.646 --> 52:49.313
You tell me now.

52:49.563 --> 52:52.480
- Telling you.
- Tell me now.

52:54.646 --> 52:56.105
Guddu, don't leave him.

52:57.063 --> 52:58.813
- Uncle, hold him.
- Hold him.

52:59.355 --> 53:00.230
Hold him tight.

53:01.438 --> 53:02.813
- Johnny, hold him.
- I'm holding him.

53:03.355 --> 53:05.063
- Hey…
- Hold him, please.

53:07.021 --> 53:08.270
Tell me quickly. Where's the treasure?

53:08.271 --> 53:09.271
Don't let go!

53:11.105 --> 53:12.146
Look ahead!

53:19.396 --> 53:20.605
Where are we going, bro?

53:21.105 --> 53:22.021
Down in the ravine.

53:36.396 --> 53:38.021
- Where has he gone?
- Where's Prithvi?

53:43.938 --> 53:45.813
Oh, shit, bro!

53:46.271 --> 53:48.480
He really went down to earth, bro!

53:49.396 --> 53:50.855
If someone falls from this cliff,

53:51.521 --> 53:53.771
even God can't save him.

53:53.938 --> 53:55.313
We lost the treasure
because of you, Guddu.

53:55.771 --> 53:57.563
You're a complete failure.

53:57.855 --> 54:00.312
Hey, you both are responsible for this.

54:00.313 --> 54:02.563
Hey. Stop shouting at us.
It's not our mistake.

54:02.938 --> 54:05.355
It's not your mistake?
Both of you are a mistake!

54:06.063 --> 54:08.938
I wonder what came to my mind
that I thought of being your dad.

54:09.396 --> 54:10.980
- I wish to throw you…
- Hey!

54:12.063 --> 54:14.771
- His weight is too much.
- Help!

54:15.146 --> 54:16.813
Hey, I just threatened you.

54:17.396 --> 54:18.563
Why are you shouting?
I didn't throw you for real.

54:19.396 --> 54:21.271
Somebody, please help.

54:23.021 --> 54:25.396
Over here.

54:25.813 --> 54:27.230
- Bro!
- That hand!

54:27.980 --> 54:32.771
Help!

54:33.271 --> 54:37.271
Help! Please!

54:37.605 --> 54:40.312
Bro, Prithvi. Prithvi is alive.
Prithvi is alive.

54:40.313 --> 54:41.437
- Prithvi is alive!
- Prithvi is safe!

54:41.438 --> 54:43.688
- Prithvi is alive!
- Our treasure is safe.

54:44.230 --> 54:45.146
Our treasure?

54:46.355 --> 54:47.605
Yes, of course.

54:48.355 --> 54:50.354
- We are a family, right?
- Yes. Family.

54:50.355 --> 54:51.313
Family.

54:51.855 --> 54:54.480
Before the property gets divided,

54:54.980 --> 54:56.395
you'd better reduce the family size.
Throw them down.

54:56.396 --> 54:58.479
- Why? Who do you think you are?
- Help!

54:58.480 --> 54:59.937
- Help! Help!
- Help!

54:59.938 --> 55:01.438
Guddu, save him first.

55:01.813 --> 55:02.688
Yes.

55:03.021 --> 55:03.979
You're a champ, Guddu.

55:03.980 --> 55:05.771
- Yes, Guddu. You can do it.
- You can do it.

55:06.021 --> 55:06.979
- Come on, Guddu!
- You can do it.

55:06.980 --> 55:07.855
Stop it.

55:08.105 --> 55:09.605
Let him concentrate.

55:10.396 --> 55:12.687
Yes, you can do it, Guddu.

55:12.688 --> 55:13.980
Guddu, you can do it.

55:14.188 --> 55:15.188
Come on, Guddu!
You can do it.

55:15.521 --> 55:17.020
- You can do it.
- Concentrate, bro.

55:17.021 --> 55:18.105
You can do it, Guddu.

55:18.271 --> 55:20.354
- Ram, Ram, Ram, Ram.
- Yes, you can do it.

55:20.355 --> 55:21.980
It's a matter of treasure.
Please, Guddu.

55:22.105 --> 55:24.145
- Ram, Ram, Ram, Ram.
- Yes, you can do it. You can do it.

55:24.146 --> 55:25.270
- Ram, Ram, Ram.
- Yes, you can do it.

55:25.271 --> 55:26.355
- Ram, Ram, Ram.
- You can do it.

55:26.646 --> 55:28.146
- Ram, Ram, Ram.
- You can do it.

55:28.271 --> 55:31.479
- You can do it.
- Ram, Ram, Ram.

55:31.480 --> 55:33.354
- Guddu, be careful!
- Ram! Ram! Ram!

55:33.355 --> 55:35.438
- I'm dead. I'm dead. I'm dead.
- You can do it.

55:35.605 --> 55:38.313
Guddu! Guddu, careful!

55:41.563 --> 55:42.730
Oh no!

55:43.230 --> 55:45.230
What happened, Guddu?

55:45.521 --> 55:48.771
Johnny, do something.
Save me.

55:48.938 --> 55:50.313
- God!
- Bro, I'm there.

55:50.563 --> 55:52.938
I will teach you how to walk
on such a slippery surface.

55:53.063 --> 55:53.938
Just now.

55:54.063 --> 55:55.604
- Watch me, okay?
- Yeah, yeah.

55:55.605 --> 55:56.562
- All the best!
- What?

55:56.563 --> 55:57.605
All the best!

55:57.813 --> 55:58.770
Johnny!

55:58.771 --> 56:00.230
- Yes.
- You can do it, Uncle.

56:00.396 --> 56:01.396
- You can do it.
- Coming.

56:01.605 --> 56:02.604
- Coming.
- Yes.

56:02.605 --> 56:03.563
- Uncle.
- Coming.

56:04.980 --> 56:05.937
- Oh no, Uncle.
- Be careful, Uncle.

56:05.938 --> 56:10.354
- Look here. Place your right leg first…
- Be careful.

56:10.355 --> 56:13.395
- Then take your left leg…
- Uncle, be careful!

56:13.396 --> 56:17.230
- Then the right… and then left…
- Be careful!

56:24.813 --> 56:25.937
Even this idiot has slipped.

56:25.938 --> 56:28.313
Have you come to rescue me
or kill me?

56:28.563 --> 56:32.146
Bro, this life is meaningless
without you. I love you.

56:32.480 --> 56:33.437
Get lost.

56:33.438 --> 56:35.145
Guddu, are you okay?

56:35.146 --> 56:36.063
I'm okay so far.

56:36.563 --> 56:37.562
But it won't be the same
for a long time.

56:37.563 --> 56:38.895
Go and seek help.

56:38.896 --> 56:40.605
- Yes, we're going.
- Yes, we will. Come, Aarav.

56:40.980 --> 56:43.230
Help!

56:48.563 --> 56:49.937
Keep the plot's documents properly.

56:49.938 --> 56:50.895
- Yes.
- Stop! Stop!

56:50.896 --> 56:51.854
- Help! Help!
- Help!

56:51.855 --> 56:52.771
How did these kids come here?

56:53.938 --> 56:55.396
- Oh no!
- Look in the front.

57:00.563 --> 57:04.271
- Help! Help!
- I'm here.

57:04.438 --> 57:06.688
Because you're there, I need help.

57:07.438 --> 57:08.355
Go back.

57:11.355 --> 57:14.188
- Adi! Adi, accident!
- Are you alright?

57:14.355 --> 57:16.771
You should be in school.
What are you doing here?

57:16.938 --> 57:18.520
- Do you wish to die?
- We need help!

57:18.521 --> 57:20.355
No! We need help…

57:20.730 --> 57:22.396
My auto's seat is broken.

57:23.021 --> 57:24.646
Moreover, she fell on me.

57:24.896 --> 57:26.563
I was almost dead.

57:26.730 --> 57:29.396
You should have thought about your
auto before taking the passenger.

57:29.605 --> 57:30.688
He's not an auto driver.

57:31.188 --> 57:33.770
- He's my husband.
- You need not give the details.

57:33.771 --> 57:36.355
- But…
- Who will pay for the damage?

57:36.480 --> 57:39.604
You've willingly married her.
Why should we pay for the damage?

57:39.605 --> 57:40.480
Hey, you…

57:47.021 --> 57:48.479
He knows the secret to the treasure.

57:48.480 --> 57:49.480
Pay for the damage!

57:52.105 --> 57:53.230
Can you please repeat that?

57:53.480 --> 57:55.730
He knows the location
of Shaitan Singh's treasure.

57:57.146 --> 57:58.188
I know about this.

57:58.688 --> 57:59.980
It's a 100-year-old treasure.

58:00.188 --> 58:01.646
Shaitan Singh's treasure!

58:02.396 --> 58:03.354
Yes.

58:03.355 --> 58:04.813
There's something called humanity.

58:05.896 --> 58:07.188
I will save the treasure.

58:07.438 --> 58:09.063
I mean the man who needs help.

58:09.355 --> 58:10.312
Where's he hanging?

58:10.313 --> 58:12.687
- That side.
- Bring a rope. Quick. Manav.

58:12.688 --> 58:14.312
- Adi, every time we've run after money,
- What?

58:14.313 --> 58:15.480
- we've ended up getting in problems.
- Zip it!

58:15.771 --> 58:16.771
- Adi, thrice…
- Keep quiet.

58:17.063 --> 58:19.188
- Adi, we end up with nothing.
- Quiet. Bring a rope.

58:19.646 --> 58:20.604
- Where?
- Okay.

58:20.605 --> 58:21.562
- They're there.
- Let's go.

58:21.563 --> 58:22.520
- Come on.
- Let's go.

58:22.521 --> 58:23.479
Come on.

58:23.480 --> 58:24.730
- Let's go and find the treasure.
- Come fast.

58:25.230 --> 58:27.271
Oh no. This is dangerous.

58:28.146 --> 58:29.063
Over there.

58:33.521 --> 58:34.646
Don't worry.

58:34.980 --> 58:36.270
We will rescue you.

58:36.271 --> 58:39.688
Yes, we will rescue you as well
as the secret to the treasure.

58:39.938 --> 58:42.188
You told them about the treasure?

58:42.313 --> 58:44.438
We had to tell them
before they agreed to help!

58:44.771 --> 58:47.355
Now, quickly tell us
the secret to the treasure.

58:47.480 --> 58:48.771
Then we will rescue you.

58:49.021 --> 58:51.063
Between the two of you,
who knows the secret to the treasure?

58:51.271 --> 58:53.313
You idiots!

58:53.938 --> 58:56.313
Only I know the secret to the treasure.

58:56.980 --> 58:58.688
Hurry up and rescue me.

58:59.021 --> 59:00.355
Who said that?

59:00.480 --> 59:02.146
Your dad, the one who's hanging.

59:02.396 --> 59:04.313
My dad hanged himself from the fan.

59:04.688 --> 59:05.771
Where is he hanging?

59:06.021 --> 59:06.979
Leave that.

59:06.980 --> 59:09.480
Tell us clearly,
who do we have to rescue?

59:09.688 --> 59:11.438
The two of you?
Or the one who's hanging?

59:11.563 --> 59:13.729
Rescue all three of us.

59:13.730 --> 59:15.063
Hey, oldie.

59:15.396 --> 59:16.730
The other guy who's hanging
knows the secret.

59:17.146 --> 59:18.354
Why should we rescue you?

59:18.355 --> 59:20.063
Hurry up, man. Please.

59:20.438 --> 59:22.521
Stop the discussion.
Rescue all of them.

59:22.730 --> 59:24.021
Manav, throw that rope.

59:24.230 --> 59:25.271
- Yes.
- Okay.

59:38.521 --> 59:40.813
Idiot, what have you done?

59:42.605 --> 59:43.562
What have you done?

59:43.563 --> 59:44.855
You've thrown the rope
into the valley?

59:45.271 --> 59:47.313
You told me to throw the rope,
which I did.

59:47.646 --> 59:52.605
Don't waste time, man.
Hurry up. Help!

59:53.438 --> 59:54.938
How do we save them now?

59:55.063 --> 59:56.063
I've got an idea.

59:56.313 --> 59:58.396
Let's hold each other's hands
and make a human chain.

59:58.563 --> 01:00:00.854
- Okay.
- Fine, who would lead the human chain?

01:00:00.855 --> 01:00:01.730
Come forward!

01:00:03.563 --> 01:00:04.896
Uncle, you're the bravest of all.

01:00:05.563 --> 01:00:07.355
Me? Brave? How?

01:00:07.730 --> 01:00:08.730
That's why you came forward.

01:00:08.938 --> 01:00:09.813
No, I didn't.

01:00:13.980 --> 01:00:15.938
I don't know how,
but every time there's danger,

01:00:16.188 --> 01:00:18.188
I somehow end up stepping
forward first.

01:00:18.480 --> 01:00:19.688
Adi!

01:00:21.271 --> 01:00:23.521
Help! Please, hurry up.

01:00:23.771 --> 01:00:24.813
But where are you?

01:00:25.063 --> 01:00:25.938
Where are you?

01:00:26.146 --> 01:00:27.146
Go ahead and check.

01:00:32.730 --> 01:00:34.021
Don't let go of the hand.

01:00:34.271 --> 01:00:35.980
Hold each other's hands.

01:00:36.230 --> 01:00:37.730
Hold each other's hands tightly.

01:00:38.313 --> 01:00:41.313
Listen, extend your hand.
Extend your hand.

01:00:42.980 --> 01:00:44.312
Very good!

01:00:44.313 --> 01:00:45.646
Come on. Keep holding my hands.

01:00:46.188 --> 01:00:48.563
Please, do something.

01:00:50.105 --> 01:00:52.105
Give your hand. Come on.

01:00:52.396 --> 01:00:54.313
Okay… don't move now.

01:00:55.855 --> 01:00:58.104
Don't worry.
I'm holding this tree.

01:00:58.105 --> 01:01:01.438
The tree won't run away.
Hold me tightly.

01:01:01.855 --> 01:01:02.730
Stand straight, all of you.

01:01:03.230 --> 01:01:04.645
I will try to reach him.

01:01:04.646 --> 01:01:06.063
Yes. Bro, concentrate.

01:01:06.438 --> 01:01:08.020
Concentrate!

01:01:08.021 --> 01:01:09.813
- Bro, concentrate.
- Bend, guys. Bend a little.

01:01:09.980 --> 01:01:11.480
- Bend a little more.
- Concentrate!

01:01:11.646 --> 01:01:12.605
- Bend more.
- Concentrate.

01:01:12.855 --> 01:01:14.480
- Concentrate.
- Enough. We're bending too much.

01:01:14.646 --> 01:01:15.563
Come on.

01:01:15.938 --> 01:01:16.895
Come. Come.

01:01:16.896 --> 01:01:18.562
Come on.

01:01:18.563 --> 01:01:19.730
- Come on.
- Be careful!

01:01:19.980 --> 01:01:21.271
Come down a little.

01:01:24.521 --> 01:01:26.063
Why are they going in reverse?

01:01:26.271 --> 01:01:28.313
Who's dragging everyone?

01:01:29.063 --> 01:01:33.480
- Oh no!
- Guddu, please don't do that.

01:01:35.063 --> 01:01:36.937
Very good!

01:01:36.938 --> 01:01:38.312
Yes! Yes!

01:01:38.313 --> 01:01:40.188
Yes, Guddu! Very good!

01:01:40.980 --> 01:01:42.062
Very good, Guddu!

01:01:42.063 --> 01:01:43.438
Be careful! Come!

01:01:43.896 --> 01:01:45.730
- Come. Come.
- Come down a little. Come.

01:01:45.938 --> 01:01:47.230
The cliff has become an escalator.

01:01:51.105 --> 01:01:51.980
Oh no!

01:01:52.605 --> 01:01:54.396
Hey, Guddu!

01:01:54.688 --> 01:01:56.605
- Guddu!
- Prithvi.

01:01:57.438 --> 01:01:58.480
- Guddu.
- Yes?

01:01:58.688 --> 01:02:00.271
I'm losing my grip!

01:02:02.396 --> 01:02:05.438
I'm going straight out in one shot!

01:02:05.938 --> 01:02:08.521
Guddu, I'm gone.

01:02:08.730 --> 01:02:10.563
Don't be scared! I'll pull you up.

01:02:10.855 --> 01:02:12.146
- Wait!
- Guddu!

01:02:12.980 --> 01:02:14.980
I betrayed you so many times,

01:02:15.855 --> 01:02:18.605
yet every single time,
you saved me. But now…

01:02:19.271 --> 01:02:20.188
I won't survive.

01:02:20.896 --> 01:02:23.646
This is the punishment for my greed.

01:02:23.855 --> 01:02:25.563
Hey, stop this emotional drama!

01:02:25.730 --> 01:02:26.730
Tell us the secret of the treasure.

01:02:27.271 --> 01:02:29.938
And tell him to say the location
of the treasure loudly.

01:02:30.188 --> 01:02:32.770
- Otherwise, my hand will slip.
- Hey!

01:02:32.771 --> 01:02:34.271
Speak louder! Louder! Come on.

01:02:35.021 --> 01:02:40.646
Janakpur Jetty is 50 kilometers from here.

01:02:41.730 --> 01:02:47.063
From there, 120 kilometers south
into the sea,

01:02:47.730 --> 01:02:50.729
there's an island.

01:02:50.730 --> 01:02:51.605
An island.

01:02:52.105 --> 01:02:53.145
What's the name?

01:02:53.146 --> 01:02:55.188
Prithvi Deshpande!

01:02:55.480 --> 01:02:56.730
What do we do with your name?

01:02:56.938 --> 01:02:57.813
Tell us the name of that island.

01:02:58.063 --> 01:03:00.771
The island does not have any name.

01:03:00.980 --> 01:03:02.605
How do I search on Google Maps?

01:03:02.896 --> 01:03:04.605
Come on, it must have a name.

01:03:05.188 --> 01:03:06.896
Do you want to make
an identity card for that island?

01:03:07.938 --> 01:03:08.813
Please, continue.

01:03:09.063 --> 01:03:12.813
You will easily identify that island.

01:03:13.730 --> 01:03:18.646
There's a giant "M" on the island.
A giant "M".

01:03:18.980 --> 01:03:20.896
- "M."
- "M" for mother?

01:03:21.146 --> 01:03:22.021
Yes.

01:03:22.563 --> 01:03:24.063
"M" for Mother.

01:03:24.563 --> 01:03:27.187
Adi, I miss Mom.

01:03:27.188 --> 01:03:28.730
This is not the time, Manav!

01:03:29.355 --> 01:03:32.105
But how do we identify that giant "M"?

01:03:32.813 --> 01:03:34.979
That giant "M" is made out of mountains.

01:03:34.980 --> 01:03:37.355
You'll be able to spot it from far away.

01:03:38.188 --> 01:03:41.105
But to reach that "M",

01:03:41.605 --> 01:03:45.438
you'll have to pass through
a dense and dangerous jungle!

01:03:45.688 --> 01:03:46.688
Tell us,

01:03:46.938 --> 01:03:49.437
where will we find the treasure
once we reach that giant "M"?

01:03:49.438 --> 01:03:50.813
Yes, please clarify that.

01:03:51.063 --> 01:03:53.146
The treasure is beneath that giant "M",

01:03:54.230 --> 01:03:57.396
behind an "O".

01:03:57.563 --> 01:03:58.562
- Behind what?
- Behind an "O"?

01:03:58.563 --> 01:04:00.855
Beneath the "M",

01:04:01.688 --> 01:04:07.521
behind an "O".

01:04:12.855 --> 01:04:14.645
- He's gone.
- Hey, Adi.

01:04:14.646 --> 01:04:15.521
He's gone.

01:04:15.646 --> 01:04:16.646
Adi, even he is gone.

01:04:17.105 --> 01:04:19.355
- Who?
- The one who held my hand.

01:04:21.438 --> 01:04:23.313
Hold him. Hold him.

01:04:29.688 --> 01:04:31.230
- We are safe. We are safe.
- Guddu…

01:04:31.605 --> 01:04:33.563
We are safe. We are safe.

01:04:33.688 --> 01:04:37.021
It feels like death
itself is coming for us.

01:04:37.146 --> 01:04:38.812
Hey, snail, crawl up.

01:04:38.813 --> 01:04:40.980
Manav, pull up.

01:04:41.271 --> 01:04:43.313
Adi, we will die.

01:04:43.480 --> 01:04:46.437
Don't worry. Cheaters like us
don't die so easily.

01:04:46.438 --> 01:04:47.813
Keep moving. Carefully.

01:04:48.313 --> 01:04:49.438
Come on. Carefully.

01:04:49.813 --> 01:04:52.021
- Come on. Come on, Manav.
- Yes. Come.

01:04:54.396 --> 01:04:55.271
What was that?

01:04:56.688 --> 01:04:57.563
What's happening?

01:05:01.896 --> 01:05:03.813
- Adi…
- Come on, Manav.

01:05:12.021 --> 01:05:13.562
Manav, crawl up fast.
Hurry up.

01:05:13.563 --> 01:05:15.480
I am trying, Adi. I am trying.

01:05:16.646 --> 01:05:17.687
Pull up, Manav.

01:05:17.688 --> 01:05:19.813
- Crawl up, man.
- Hurry up.

01:05:20.521 --> 01:05:22.105
Come on up.

01:05:22.355 --> 01:05:24.271
Hurry up. Come on.

01:05:25.438 --> 01:05:28.021
- Hurry up.
- Come on, Manav. Come on.

01:05:28.146 --> 01:05:30.230
Come on. We're almost there.

01:05:31.271 --> 01:05:32.188
Hey…

01:05:33.355 --> 01:05:34.312
Sorry, bro.

01:05:34.313 --> 01:05:36.646
- Sorry for what, bro?
- For this.

01:05:38.146 --> 01:05:39.563
Hey, Uncle Johnny!

01:05:41.688 --> 01:05:43.812
- He said sorry, then kicked me, bro!
- Adi!

01:05:43.813 --> 01:05:44.979
- Uncle, this is cheating.
- Adi, let's go.

01:05:44.980 --> 01:05:46.562
- This is cheating!
- I like to cheat! I like to cheat!

01:05:46.563 --> 01:05:48.230
- Let's go, Manav.
- Uncle, this is cheating.

01:05:48.396 --> 01:05:49.313
Johnny!

01:05:49.688 --> 01:05:52.895
- Come on, Johnny. Crawl up.
- Try it to climb up.

01:05:52.896 --> 01:05:54.562
- Yes, crawl up. Try.
- Yes, try to crawl up.

01:05:54.563 --> 01:05:55.980
- Crawl.
- Yes, very good.

01:05:56.396 --> 01:05:59.355
- Good! Very good!
- Don't give up. Very good.

01:06:01.480 --> 01:06:03.313
- Careful!
- Be careful!

01:06:03.563 --> 01:06:04.855
I got hold of the branch, bro!

01:06:06.438 --> 01:06:07.562
- Come up.
- Come on.

01:06:07.563 --> 01:06:08.687
I hope this tree won't get uprooted.

01:06:08.688 --> 01:06:10.480
- Oh, no! Come with me!
- Oh, no!

01:06:12.688 --> 01:06:14.480
Don't let go, Johnny! Hang on!

01:06:16.063 --> 01:06:17.521
Bro, keep holding tight!

01:06:25.771 --> 01:06:28.355
Wait. Hold on tight.

01:06:28.563 --> 01:06:29.813
- Bro!
- Don't let go!

01:06:29.980 --> 01:06:31.271
- Johnny!
- I won't!

01:06:32.230 --> 01:06:34.230
Nala and Neela built the Ram Setu bridge.

01:06:34.563 --> 01:06:37.229
- You make me your bridge. Bro.
- I'm coming.

01:06:37.230 --> 01:06:38.770
- Hold on tight.
- Don't worry, bro.

01:06:38.771 --> 01:06:40.355
No, I can't…

01:06:41.521 --> 01:06:44.105
Wait, Johnny.
Don't let go, Johnny.

01:06:44.355 --> 01:06:46.605
Johnny, don't let go.
Don't let go.

01:06:48.521 --> 01:06:49.605
Pull me up, bro.

01:06:50.563 --> 01:06:52.688
Hold on. Let me catch my breath.

01:06:53.438 --> 01:06:54.771
Johnny, wait and see.

01:06:55.271 --> 01:06:57.562
No one can take the treasure except me.

01:06:57.563 --> 01:07:01.062
Shut up! I'll take the treasure!

01:07:01.063 --> 01:07:04.396
Paro, hop in! Quick!
We'll fly to the treasure.

01:07:05.438 --> 01:07:06.438
Yes, I'm coming.

01:07:07.105 --> 01:07:08.063
Is it fine?

01:07:12.438 --> 01:07:14.105
It's really windy, Paro.

01:07:14.563 --> 01:07:16.063
Hey, my hot-air balloon!

01:07:19.230 --> 01:07:20.230
My hot-air balloon!

01:07:24.771 --> 01:07:26.104
My hot-air balloon!

01:07:26.105 --> 01:07:28.646
Bye-bye!
We will return it to you soon!

01:07:31.188 --> 01:07:32.270
My hot-air balloon!

01:07:32.271 --> 01:07:35.146
Will you turn this bicycle into
an airplane to catch us?

01:07:35.563 --> 01:07:37.563
Look in the front.
Look in the front.

01:07:40.730 --> 01:07:41.937
See, you caused an accident.

01:07:41.938 --> 01:07:44.563
Goodbye! Enjoy the fish fry!

01:07:45.271 --> 01:07:46.146
Listen,

01:07:46.980 --> 01:07:49.937
we shouldn't have
left them to die.

01:07:49.938 --> 01:07:51.230
Nothing will happen to them.

01:07:51.563 --> 01:07:53.480
All of them are cheaters.

01:07:53.855 --> 01:07:55.313
They must have managed to crawl up
and must be chasing us.

01:07:56.438 --> 01:07:57.813
You weren't in <i>Total Dhamaal,</i> right?

01:07:58.271 --> 01:07:59.146
But I was there.

01:07:59.855 --> 01:08:02.855
Stop thinking about them.
Enjoy this scenery.

01:08:04.355 --> 01:08:05.855
Hey, look there.

01:08:07.938 --> 01:08:10.021
Such a beautiful Indra Kumar.

01:08:10.980 --> 01:08:14.063
Well, it's "Indra Dhanush".

01:08:14.521 --> 01:08:16.271
Whatever it is.

01:08:16.646 --> 01:08:18.188
Both are exceptional.

01:08:19.396 --> 01:08:20.688
Someday I will tell you their stories.

01:08:21.855 --> 01:08:23.980
Listen to this story right away.
At the time of shooting…

01:08:28.563 --> 01:08:32.354
My boat.

01:08:32.355 --> 01:08:33.979
Adi, that fatso is running after us.

01:08:33.980 --> 01:08:36.355
My boat.
I won't let you go.

01:08:37.646 --> 01:08:38.645
Oh no!

01:08:38.646 --> 01:08:39.771
He fell into the water.

01:08:40.355 --> 01:08:41.937
I don't know him.
Leave it. Look in the front.

01:08:41.938 --> 01:08:42.895
Okay.

01:08:42.896 --> 01:08:45.271
Adi! That bearded beggar left us
and ran away.

01:08:45.855 --> 01:08:47.355
Bloody basket! Cheater cock.

01:08:47.605 --> 01:08:48.605
He was quite cunning.

01:08:48.730 --> 01:08:50.729
If I find him, I won't spare him.

01:08:50.730 --> 01:08:51.646
Yes, Adi.

01:09:07.938 --> 01:09:08.938
Bro, what have you done?

01:09:10.188 --> 01:09:11.896
Hey, my boat. My boat.

01:09:13.021 --> 01:09:15.438
- Yeah…
- Bro.

01:09:16.146 --> 01:09:18.563
Were these greedy idiots the only people
you could find to ask for help?

01:09:18.938 --> 01:09:20.395
Those fellows ran away, leaving
us to die!

01:09:20.396 --> 01:09:22.354
But they looked decent
and innocent to us!

01:09:22.355 --> 01:09:24.563
How can you tell if someone
is decent just by his face?

01:09:24.896 --> 01:09:25.771
Just look at bro!

01:09:26.313 --> 01:09:27.937
- Hey, you…
- I am sorry.

01:09:27.938 --> 01:09:29.355
- Control the boat.
- Bro…

01:09:29.521 --> 01:09:30.521
Bro! Bro!

01:09:32.105 --> 01:09:33.230
I won't spare those people.

01:09:33.396 --> 01:09:34.729
Hey, first pick up some speed.

01:09:34.730 --> 01:09:37.146
- Yeah, speed up, Guddu!
- Speed up.

01:09:42.271 --> 01:09:45.896
Paro, you may have played
with the balloons in childhood.

01:09:46.313 --> 01:09:47.313
But did you ever imagine

01:09:47.480 --> 01:09:49.646
that one day you would fly
in a hot air balloon?

01:09:50.730 --> 01:09:52.230
Never imagined it…

01:09:52.521 --> 01:09:54.687
But this is so much fun!

01:09:54.688 --> 01:09:56.271
When we find the treasure,

01:09:56.688 --> 01:09:58.313
it'll be even more fun.

01:10:09.271 --> 01:10:10.313
How much do you eat?

01:10:10.730 --> 01:10:12.521
Your stomach is rumbling so loudly!

01:10:14.730 --> 01:10:16.230
My stomach isn't upset.

01:10:17.396 --> 01:10:18.271
Look over there.

01:10:18.646 --> 01:10:19.896
Your stomach will get upset.

01:10:27.355 --> 01:10:28.480
Not just the stomach.

01:10:28.896 --> 01:10:31.021
Pants will get ruined, too.

01:10:38.021 --> 01:10:39.938
Once we get our hands
on this treasure,

01:10:40.063 --> 01:10:41.980
we'll become billionaires very soon!

01:10:42.521 --> 01:10:44.687
According to that, how much
is my share, <i>bhabhi?</i>

01:10:44.688 --> 01:10:46.729
Simple, Manav.
One share yours, one mine,

01:10:46.730 --> 01:10:47.813
and one will be of your <i>bhabhi's.</i>

01:10:48.105 --> 01:10:49.230
Not so simple.

01:10:49.438 --> 01:10:51.230
There will only be two shares
of the treasure.

01:10:51.396 --> 01:10:53.980
Okay? One share is ours,
and one share is ours.

01:10:54.188 --> 01:10:55.188
One share for me,

01:10:55.355 --> 01:10:56.938
and one share for you two together.

01:10:57.105 --> 01:10:58.062
How does that make sense?!

01:10:58.063 --> 01:10:59.188
Two of you are one unit, right?

01:10:59.480 --> 01:11:01.729
Yeah, Adi! Actually, we've been
brothers since childhood. Right?

01:11:01.730 --> 01:11:02.980
Get lost.
"Brothers"!

01:11:08.396 --> 01:11:09.271
Look there.

01:11:10.063 --> 01:11:10.938
Over there.

01:11:15.271 --> 01:11:17.271
Oh no! Adi,

01:11:17.438 --> 01:11:19.563
it seems the God of death
has found us again.

01:11:19.730 --> 01:11:22.938
Mom, we are coming. Adi…

01:11:29.396 --> 01:11:31.562
Guddu, if we find
Shaitaan Singh's treasure,

01:11:31.563 --> 01:11:32.980
how rich will we become?

01:11:33.230 --> 01:11:35.855
So rich that every Christmas,
you'll be giving gifts to Santa Claus!

01:11:37.188 --> 01:11:38.563
I'm going to go shopping
every single day!

01:11:38.688 --> 01:11:40.521
And what will you do,
Uncle Johnny?

01:11:40.730 --> 01:11:43.480
Nothing. I'll find a nice match
and get married, bro.

01:11:43.896 --> 01:11:44.771
Johnny dear,

01:11:45.355 --> 01:11:47.813
at your age, not marriage proposals,
but angels come.

01:11:48.146 --> 01:11:49.730
And that too, to take you
away with them.

01:11:58.521 --> 01:12:02.812
Bro… who's going to save us
from this angel of death, bro?

01:12:02.813 --> 01:12:03.813
What do we do, Uncle?

01:12:18.896 --> 01:12:20.646
Help!

01:12:21.563 --> 01:12:22.521
Mom!

01:13:01.438 --> 01:13:02.521
What's happening?

01:13:06.730 --> 01:13:07.730
Oh, God!

01:13:08.313 --> 01:13:10.146
Please, save us this time.

01:13:11.021 --> 01:13:12.563
I promise,

01:13:13.396 --> 01:13:14.438
if we survive this storm,

01:13:15.063 --> 01:13:18.730
I'll offer you 500 kilos of sweets.

01:13:36.730 --> 01:13:40.521
- We survived! We survived!
- We survived.

01:13:41.021 --> 01:13:44.563
Now, just remember to offer God
those sweets worth 150,000 rupees.

01:13:45.730 --> 01:13:46.646
How 150,000?

01:13:47.896 --> 01:13:49.230
You said 500 kilos.

01:13:49.688 --> 01:13:50.895
At 300 rupees per kilo,

01:13:50.896 --> 01:13:52.063
it will be 150,000 rupees'
worth of sweets, right?

01:13:53.938 --> 01:13:55.396
You heard me wrong.

01:13:55.688 --> 01:13:57.021
I didn't say 500 kilos,

01:13:57.271 --> 01:14:00.230
I said 500 grams. 500 grams.

01:14:03.730 --> 01:14:07.395
Why do you turn away
from your promise to God?

01:14:07.396 --> 01:14:09.354
How do you know that?

01:14:09.355 --> 01:14:11.313
I wasn't a part of <i>Total Dhamaal.</i>

01:14:11.480 --> 01:14:12.938
But I had watched it.

01:14:19.188 --> 01:14:21.771
Fire! There's a fire.

01:14:22.230 --> 01:14:24.355
We're going to die.
We're going to die.

01:14:24.480 --> 01:14:27.271
No! I won't let anything
happen to my husband.

01:14:27.396 --> 01:14:28.980
You cannot die.

01:14:31.480 --> 01:14:33.438
Hail Bajrangbali!

01:14:35.605 --> 01:14:38.313
Oh, my husband!

01:14:40.855 --> 01:14:43.021
Where are you going,
leaving me behind?

01:14:43.521 --> 01:14:49.188
I'm leaving the whole world behind.

01:14:51.563 --> 01:14:54.063
See you in the next life now.

01:14:54.771 --> 01:14:58.771
Goodbye.

01:15:05.313 --> 01:15:07.729
Thank God,
I have no motion sickness.

01:15:07.730 --> 01:15:08.687
- Adi.
- Yes.

01:15:08.688 --> 01:15:12.562
Looks like Lord Yamaraj
has sent his entire army after us.

01:15:12.563 --> 01:15:14.063
- Yes, Manav.
- I told you

01:15:14.396 --> 01:15:15.896
not to take a boat named <i>Titanic.</i>

01:15:16.480 --> 01:15:18.354
It'll sink. We're all going to die.

01:15:18.355 --> 01:15:20.313
None of you will die.

01:15:20.521 --> 01:15:22.438
Because I will save everyone.

01:15:23.771 --> 01:15:24.646
Oh no!

01:15:26.521 --> 01:15:28.688
Octopus!

01:15:35.188 --> 01:15:36.938
Manav, hit the octopus.

01:15:37.563 --> 01:15:38.438
Hit it.

01:15:38.896 --> 01:15:40.688
Break his legs.

01:15:43.605 --> 01:15:44.938
Oh shit!

01:15:47.355 --> 01:15:48.355
Where's the octopus?

01:15:51.146 --> 01:15:52.313
Bloody basket!

01:15:52.646 --> 01:15:54.855
Attacked my <i>bhabhi?</i>
I'll smash your head.

01:15:55.313 --> 01:15:56.230
No… no… no…

01:15:56.896 --> 01:15:57.771
Don't hit it.

01:15:58.396 --> 01:15:59.395
Pull it off!

01:15:59.396 --> 01:16:00.604
Okay, okay…

01:16:00.605 --> 01:16:01.480
Leave.

01:16:01.771 --> 01:16:03.438
Let go, you bald idiot.

01:16:03.646 --> 01:16:06.063
I'll turn you into salad.

01:16:09.021 --> 01:16:09.896
Come out.

01:16:11.646 --> 01:16:13.771
Leave my <i>bhabhi</i> if you love your life.

01:16:14.021 --> 01:16:16.146
Leave her. Let go.

01:16:17.355 --> 01:16:18.313
I said let go.

01:16:18.771 --> 01:16:20.938
Hey! Hey, what are you doing?!

01:16:21.188 --> 01:16:22.438
I'm drowning it to death.

01:16:23.230 --> 01:16:25.605
Who are you drowning to death?!

01:16:25.896 --> 01:16:26.938
The octopus.

01:16:30.813 --> 01:16:32.688
Idiot! Your <i>bhabhi</i> will die.

01:16:32.938 --> 01:16:33.895
<i>Bhabhi</i> will die?

01:16:33.896 --> 01:16:34.980
- Take her out.
- Oh shit!

01:16:36.063 --> 01:16:37.020
What are you doing?

01:16:37.021 --> 01:16:37.938
- You will kill your <i>bhabhi.</i>
- I am sorry, Adi.

01:16:40.896 --> 01:16:44.146
Adi, this thing is attacking with
the whole family.

01:16:47.146 --> 01:16:49.855
This storm doesn't seem to stop.

01:16:50.688 --> 01:16:51.813
Don't panic!

01:16:52.688 --> 01:16:54.146
This storm will stop soon.

01:16:56.771 --> 01:16:58.105
What happened, bro?

01:16:59.938 --> 01:17:01.480
The storm didn’t stop, but the boat did.

01:17:01.938 --> 01:17:04.187
I'm not getting down to push it.

01:17:04.188 --> 01:17:05.812
I’m a senior citizen, bro.

01:17:05.813 --> 01:17:07.187
Hey, a while ago you were talking
about getting married.

01:17:07.188 --> 01:17:08.146
Now, suddenly you became
a senior citizen?

01:17:09.646 --> 01:17:11.480
Wait! I'll check.

01:17:11.813 --> 01:17:13.813
- Yeah! Check.
- Hey, leave me first.

01:17:19.563 --> 01:17:20.520
Check.

01:17:20.521 --> 01:17:23.021
Concentrate, bro. Hold this.

01:17:28.188 --> 01:17:29.688
- Start!
- Start!

01:17:32.063 --> 01:17:33.230
- Guddu!
- Guddu! Bro.

01:17:35.813 --> 01:17:36.730
Help me!

01:17:36.980 --> 01:17:39.646
- Stop the boat! I'm drowning.
- Guddu! Do something, Uncle.

01:17:40.105 --> 01:17:41.813
Hey, Johnny! Johnny, stop the boat.

01:17:42.438 --> 01:17:44.355
Johnny! Johnny, stop the boat.

01:17:44.646 --> 01:17:45.521
Okay.

01:17:48.855 --> 01:17:51.146
Hey, what are you doing?!

01:17:53.980 --> 01:17:55.146
Which button did you press?

01:17:55.355 --> 01:17:56.437
The red one.

01:17:56.438 --> 01:17:57.521
You weren't supposed to press that.

01:17:57.730 --> 01:17:59.020
Oh shit!

01:17:59.021 --> 01:18:00.896
I forgot <i>Dhamaal 1,</i> bro.

01:18:02.521 --> 01:18:03.646
Phone! Phone!

01:18:05.688 --> 01:18:07.979
Phone… Aala… Aala…

01:18:07.980 --> 01:18:08.980
Aaliya! Aaliya! Aaliya!

01:18:09.230 --> 01:18:10.396
Guddu, where are you?

01:18:10.813 --> 01:18:11.855
What are these strong winds

01:18:12.271 --> 01:18:14.146
and this storm-like noise?

01:18:14.438 --> 01:18:17.021
Oh… we… we're watching a movie.

01:18:17.271 --> 01:18:18.480
<i>"Life Trapped in a Storm."</i>

01:18:18.813 --> 01:18:19.938
Oh, okay.

01:18:20.230 --> 01:18:21.646
I hope everything is going smoothly.

01:18:21.813 --> 01:18:23.230
As smooth as water.

01:18:23.730 --> 01:18:25.437
Okay, please let me talk to the kids.

01:18:25.438 --> 01:18:27.146
Yes, just hold on.

01:18:27.313 --> 01:18:29.105
Hey, phone… Phone…

01:18:33.396 --> 01:18:34.354
Hello, Mom.

01:18:34.355 --> 01:18:36.480
Hello, dear. Are you
enjoying yourselves?

01:18:36.771 --> 01:18:38.438
Yes, we're watching a very good movie.

01:18:38.605 --> 01:18:40.021
Oh, very good!

01:18:40.188 --> 01:18:43.021
<i>Bhabhi…</i> hang up now.
Otherwise, the hero will die.

01:18:43.230 --> 01:18:45.813
I mean… the hero is dying.

01:18:45.980 --> 01:18:48.146
Good night, <i>bhabhi.</i> Good night!

01:18:48.605 --> 01:18:49.480
Hang up.

01:18:51.938 --> 01:18:52.813
Uncle!

01:18:54.146 --> 01:18:55.104
What happened?

01:18:55.105 --> 01:18:56.438
Looks like the hero isn't dying.

01:18:57.355 --> 01:18:58.396
He has actually died.

01:18:59.480 --> 01:19:00.980
A shark pulled him away.

01:19:05.521 --> 01:19:07.812
Oh shit, Guddu bro.

01:19:07.813 --> 01:19:09.771
Even you left us stranded in the middle.

01:19:10.646 --> 01:19:12.938
People leave property
behind after their death,

01:19:14.021 --> 01:19:17.271
but you left this cheap
jacket behind, bro.

01:19:17.855 --> 01:19:21.105
My fate itself is cheap.

01:19:38.355 --> 01:19:39.355
Hey, what's that?

01:19:44.480 --> 01:19:45.605
Guddu bro,

01:19:46.271 --> 01:19:48.563
is it your whole body
or just your head?

01:19:50.938 --> 01:19:53.688
Hey, Guddu is following us
like the Sarkata monster.

01:20:06.188 --> 01:20:08.980
Wow, Guddu bro! Riding a dolphin.

01:20:11.396 --> 01:20:14.480
Bro, people usually
aim for a fish's eye.

01:20:14.813 --> 01:20:17.813
But you rode on the fish.

01:20:29.188 --> 01:20:30.105
Watch out for the pole.

01:20:31.521 --> 01:20:32.438
Fool!

01:20:34.063 --> 01:20:34.980
And the thorns!

01:21:06.146 --> 01:21:07.063
Paro!

01:21:07.563 --> 01:21:08.438
Open your eyes.

01:21:18.396 --> 01:21:19.271
Hey!

01:21:19.855 --> 01:21:21.230
Hey, look there.

01:21:21.980 --> 01:21:23.521
I can see a giant "W".

01:21:27.771 --> 01:21:28.688
"W?!"

01:21:29.271 --> 01:21:31.896
We've gone so far in reverse that
we've reached the first <i>Dhamaal</i> again.

01:21:32.646 --> 01:21:35.146
Good, at least we'll get ten crores.

01:21:53.563 --> 01:21:56.230
Hey… this "W" is upside down.

01:22:00.396 --> 01:22:01.646
This is an "M".

01:22:02.563 --> 01:22:03.438
"M"!

01:22:04.188 --> 01:22:05.980
We'll have to do something.
Knife?

01:22:14.188 --> 01:22:15.105
Quickly, get up, Paro.

01:22:15.480 --> 01:22:16.438
Get up! Come on.

01:22:17.688 --> 01:22:18.563
Get up!

01:22:20.105 --> 01:22:20.980
Look there.

01:22:21.563 --> 01:22:22.605
Look there, Paro.

01:22:23.605 --> 01:22:25.230
It's a giant "M".

01:22:37.063 --> 01:22:39.812
Come on, Guddu, how many more thorns
are you going to get removed?

01:22:39.813 --> 01:22:41.146
Yes, let's go, Guddu.

01:22:41.646 --> 01:22:43.271
Have you pulled out all the thorns?

01:22:44.063 --> 01:22:44.938
Bro.

01:22:45.063 --> 01:22:46.230
Just sit in the water once.

01:22:46.980 --> 01:22:48.480
Let me check all the punctures.

01:22:49.271 --> 01:22:50.521
- Yeah.
- Shameless.

01:22:52.230 --> 01:22:54.105
Bro is in this condition
because of you two.

01:22:54.771 --> 01:22:56.063
You've come here for the treasure.

01:22:56.313 --> 01:22:59.271
Yes, because we want
a lot of money for our mom.

01:22:59.396 --> 01:23:01.437
I would have brought
the treasure for your mom.

01:23:01.438 --> 01:23:02.896
Yes, but then you too
would have come along.

01:23:03.021 --> 01:23:03.980
We don't want you.

01:23:13.646 --> 01:23:15.062
Found it. Found it.

01:23:15.063 --> 01:23:16.563
- What did you find now?
- What did you find?

01:23:19.438 --> 01:23:20.355
"M".

01:23:23.605 --> 01:23:25.395
- "M". Let's go. Come on.
- Damn!

01:23:25.396 --> 01:23:26.438
Come on. Let's go.

01:23:27.146 --> 01:23:28.730
Adi! Adi!

01:23:28.938 --> 01:23:29.980
Adi, <i>bhabhi…</i>

01:23:30.271 --> 01:23:31.271
<i>Bhabhi…</i>

01:23:31.521 --> 01:23:33.521
Adi! Adi!

01:23:33.855 --> 01:23:34.771
Adi!

01:23:35.146 --> 01:23:36.105
- Adi!
- What happened?

01:23:36.230 --> 01:23:38.396
Adi, <i>Bhabhi…</i>

01:23:38.813 --> 01:23:39.730
Half <i>bhabhi?</i>

01:23:40.230 --> 01:23:41.645
Where's the other half of <i>bhabhi?</i>

01:23:41.646 --> 01:23:43.354
<i>Bhabhi</i> has left us.

01:23:43.355 --> 01:23:45.187
- What did you do, Manav?
- Adi, please…

01:23:45.188 --> 01:23:48.230
What did you do this time
that she ran away again?

01:23:48.438 --> 01:23:49.854
Adi, I didn't do anything.

01:23:49.855 --> 01:23:51.063
It's God's doing.

01:23:51.355 --> 01:23:53.021
Today, you've
actually become a widower.

01:23:53.230 --> 01:23:54.105
Look there.

01:23:56.938 --> 01:23:58.063
Hey, Rosy!

01:23:59.313 --> 01:24:00.645
- Rosy!
<i>- Bhabhi!</i>

01:24:00.646 --> 01:24:02.355
Rosy, why did you leave me alone?

01:24:02.771 --> 01:24:04.230
I love you, Rosy.

01:24:04.480 --> 01:24:07.063
How will I live without you?

01:24:09.021 --> 01:24:09.896
Aren't you dead?

01:24:11.063 --> 01:24:12.355
Do you want me to die?

01:24:12.605 --> 01:24:15.020
- No! No. I don't want that.
- How can you even think about that?

01:24:15.021 --> 01:24:17.105
I won't spare you easily.

01:24:17.355 --> 01:24:19.438
What do you think you are?

01:24:20.063 --> 01:24:22.605
- I don't need your "sorry."
- Oh, shit!

01:24:22.771 --> 01:24:25.563
- I will hit you. You deserve that.
- Adi.

01:24:25.688 --> 01:24:27.355
Adi… <i>Bhabhi…</i>

01:24:27.480 --> 01:24:28.938
- I won't spare you.
- Adi! <i>Bhabhi…</i>

01:24:29.230 --> 01:24:30.813
Shut up!

01:24:39.105 --> 01:24:40.062
- "M".
- "M".

01:24:40.063 --> 01:24:42.520
- 'M'.
- Yes.

01:24:42.521 --> 01:24:43.813
- "M".
- Let's go.

01:25:13.521 --> 01:25:14.396
Stop.

01:25:18.230 --> 01:25:19.771
Let us go, man.

01:25:20.480 --> 01:25:22.063
We came here by mistake.

01:25:22.396 --> 01:25:23.980
Please, spare us.

01:25:26.438 --> 01:25:27.395
No… No… No…

01:25:27.396 --> 01:25:29.771
- No… No… No… please.
- No… No…

01:25:32.313 --> 01:25:33.230
We are safe.

01:25:33.896 --> 01:25:34.854
We are safe.

01:25:34.855 --> 01:25:36.771
Thank you very much
for sparing our lives.

01:25:37.105 --> 01:25:39.229
Bless me, Uncle. Bye.
Let's go.

01:25:39.230 --> 01:25:40.105
Stop.

01:25:41.230 --> 01:25:42.521
What's it now?

01:25:42.730 --> 01:25:43.771
Do not go.

01:25:44.771 --> 01:25:45.771
My man…

01:25:46.480 --> 01:25:47.480
you fight…

01:25:47.855 --> 01:25:48.771
What is he saying?

01:25:48.896 --> 01:25:49.938
If you remain alive…

01:25:50.813 --> 01:25:51.937
you can go…

01:25:51.938 --> 01:25:53.813
Are you a human or a pirated CD?

01:25:54.021 --> 01:25:55.146
Getting stuck on every dialogue.

01:25:55.438 --> 01:25:58.146
I think he's telling you

01:25:58.688 --> 01:26:00.937
to fight with his man.

01:26:00.938 --> 01:26:02.730
And if you win, we can go.

01:26:05.688 --> 01:26:06.688
Who should I fight with?

01:26:11.563 --> 01:26:12.688
Who's this Hu Ha?

01:26:13.521 --> 01:26:14.479
Hu Ha, who?

01:26:14.480 --> 01:26:15.521
Who is Hu Ha?

01:26:25.188 --> 01:26:28.355
Paro, you take the treasure and enjoy.

01:26:29.396 --> 01:26:31.438
I'm about to get finished here.

01:26:37.521 --> 01:26:38.730
Chiku, you…

01:26:39.730 --> 01:26:42.063
Both of you, fight.

01:26:43.313 --> 01:26:44.230
- Chiku?
- Chiku?

01:27:10.730 --> 01:27:12.813
Is he already standing
or yet to stand up?

01:27:16.771 --> 01:27:18.355
Will this short fellow fight with me?

01:27:22.105 --> 01:27:24.688
You look more like a grape
than a <i>chiku!</i>

01:27:28.313 --> 01:27:31.812
You can't even pluck
a mango from a tree.

01:27:31.813 --> 01:27:33.521
Will you break my bones?

01:27:35.355 --> 01:27:38.938
Hey, Paro, now we will take
the treasure and go together.

01:27:39.605 --> 01:27:43.105
I will deal with him right away.

01:27:43.563 --> 01:27:44.896
Go… Go…

01:27:59.271 --> 01:28:01.021
Why do you bite like a dog?

01:28:05.355 --> 01:28:08.105
Leave me.

01:28:15.271 --> 01:28:16.563
What are you doing?

01:28:41.855 --> 01:28:43.188
One moment.

01:28:44.396 --> 01:28:46.105
Look up. Your mother.

01:28:56.355 --> 01:28:57.271
Paro!

01:28:57.521 --> 01:28:59.646
You're thinking about
seven lifetimes together…

01:28:59.771 --> 01:29:04.438
This guy is going to kill me
for fourteen lifetimes, man!

01:29:10.980 --> 01:29:13.271
I will never have kids.

01:29:14.438 --> 01:29:16.230
You better remarry. Paro.

01:29:19.438 --> 01:29:24.855
Where did that destroyer
of my family line go?

01:29:31.855 --> 01:29:34.021
I'll send him to his maker!

01:29:34.605 --> 01:29:37.354
Paro, give me a spear.

01:29:37.355 --> 01:29:38.646
- Quickly!
- Spear…

01:29:39.230 --> 01:29:40.105
Found it.

01:29:40.605 --> 01:29:41.563
Come on, give it to me.

01:29:49.146 --> 01:29:50.438
What kind of a woman are you?

01:29:50.938 --> 01:29:53.521
You're practically
making yourself a widow.

01:29:55.396 --> 01:29:57.313
Not even one of my legs is left intact.

01:30:06.563 --> 01:30:07.480
Chiku!

01:30:13.688 --> 01:30:14.896
No… No… No…

01:30:25.563 --> 01:30:26.480
Paro…

01:30:28.396 --> 01:30:29.563
Chiku!

01:30:39.438 --> 01:30:40.313
Chiku!

01:30:45.438 --> 01:30:46.313
Chiku!

01:30:46.438 --> 01:30:47.355
Chiku!

01:30:54.271 --> 01:30:55.146
Paro?!

01:30:55.730 --> 01:30:56.980
Attention everyone.

01:30:57.396 --> 01:30:59.063
If you beat up my husband…

01:31:00.021 --> 01:31:01.480
your clan will be blown away.

01:31:02.646 --> 01:31:03.605
None of you

01:31:04.105 --> 01:31:05.188
will stay alive.

01:31:05.938 --> 01:31:06.855
Understood?

01:31:08.105 --> 01:31:10.146
We apologize!
We apologize!

01:31:10.355 --> 01:31:11.313
We apologize!

01:31:13.980 --> 01:31:16.146
No. No apology.

01:31:16.855 --> 01:31:17.771
If my husband forgives you all,

01:31:20.396 --> 01:31:21.396
only then will I forgive you.

01:31:24.105 --> 01:31:25.355
We apologize.

01:31:26.063 --> 01:31:27.688
We apologize.

01:31:28.271 --> 01:31:30.563
- We apologize.
- Leave my legs, please.

01:31:30.938 --> 01:31:32.771
It's already wounded.

01:31:35.938 --> 01:31:36.896
Let's look ahead.

01:31:42.563 --> 01:31:43.688
Why did you all stop?

01:31:54.396 --> 01:31:55.438
He's asking something.
Tell him.

01:31:55.896 --> 01:31:56.813
We are scared.

01:31:57.355 --> 01:31:59.021
What if any wild animal appears?

01:31:59.271 --> 01:32:01.271
Your general knowledge is very weak.

01:32:01.438 --> 01:32:02.896
Wild animals don't live on the islands.

01:32:03.063 --> 01:32:03.938
Hey, who is it?

01:32:06.021 --> 01:32:06.938
They do.

01:32:07.146 --> 01:32:08.437
- They do.
- Yes, they do.

01:32:08.438 --> 01:32:10.605
This tiger's general
knowledge is very weak as well.

01:32:10.813 --> 01:32:12.271
It came on an island. Idiot!

01:32:18.396 --> 01:32:19.354
Oh God!

01:32:19.355 --> 01:32:20.646
Singham on top
of another Singham!

01:32:22.271 --> 01:32:24.105
Don't get into a scuffle with it.

01:32:24.396 --> 01:32:25.396
Just run away.

01:32:32.271 --> 01:32:33.646
No… No…

01:32:35.730 --> 01:32:38.313
Hey, tiger… tiger…

01:32:39.813 --> 01:32:40.855
What will you get by hunting me?

01:32:42.271 --> 01:32:43.687
There are three more
items on the menu card.

01:32:43.688 --> 01:32:45.980
- No.
- The smaller one is very tasty.

01:32:46.438 --> 01:32:47.396
Aarav Do Pyaza.

01:32:49.105 --> 01:32:49.980
Hey!

01:32:50.188 --> 01:32:51.521
Hey, Guddu, have you lost it?

01:32:53.063 --> 01:32:54.396
Don't panic.

01:32:56.438 --> 01:32:57.813
I've read somewhere.

01:32:59.105 --> 01:33:00.230
If you keep looking into a tiger's eye,

01:33:01.230 --> 01:33:02.355
it won't attack.

01:33:02.646 --> 01:33:04.105
Come on, tiger, look. Look here.

01:33:05.521 --> 01:33:06.396
Watch!

01:33:08.146 --> 01:33:09.021
Watch!

01:33:12.063 --> 01:33:13.230
Yes… see.

01:33:13.646 --> 01:33:14.646
It turned completely docile now.

01:33:15.146 --> 01:33:16.687
- Wow!
- Told you my knowledge

01:33:16.688 --> 01:33:17.688
about tigers is spot on.

01:33:22.063 --> 01:33:22.938
What are you doing?

01:33:23.105 --> 01:33:26.063
Bro, this tiger's general
knowledge is absolutely terrible.

01:33:26.396 --> 01:33:28.146
It doesn't even know what it really is.

01:33:29.813 --> 01:33:31.646
That tiger is going
to give him a disgraceful death!

01:33:34.563 --> 01:33:35.438
Bro!

01:33:46.980 --> 01:33:47.896
Saw what I did?

01:33:54.396 --> 01:33:56.855
I've hit that idiot so hard,
it'll never come back again.

01:34:12.480 --> 01:34:13.563
Hey, why are you screaming?

01:34:14.771 --> 01:34:15.730
The tiger's gone now, right?

01:34:16.188 --> 01:34:17.063
Let's go.

01:34:19.021 --> 01:34:20.355
- Come on.
- Let's go.

01:34:20.771 --> 01:34:22.521
- Bro is a genius.
- Yeah.

01:34:32.313 --> 01:34:33.938
Adi, lizard…

01:34:34.896 --> 01:34:35.813
Lizard…

01:34:37.688 --> 01:34:38.605
You also must be tired.

01:34:38.896 --> 01:34:39.771
Go drink some water.

01:34:42.771 --> 01:34:43.730
I'm very thirsty.

01:34:44.146 --> 01:34:45.354
Let me fill the bottle.

01:34:45.355 --> 01:34:46.230
Okay.

01:34:56.188 --> 01:34:59.895
Adi, you did a good thing
by giving water to the lizard.

01:34:59.896 --> 01:35:01.396
Mom will be so proud of you.

01:35:01.813 --> 01:35:03.104
- What?
- Yeah. Look there.

01:35:03.105 --> 01:35:05.188
It was so thin and small.
After drinking water, it became so huge.

01:35:05.938 --> 01:35:07.396
That's not a lizard.
That's your <i>bhabhi.</i>

01:35:08.688 --> 01:35:10.520
Not her. The one next to her.

01:35:10.521 --> 01:35:11.396
Take a look.

01:35:13.938 --> 01:35:14.855
Oh shit!

01:35:16.646 --> 01:35:18.938
Idiot, that's not a lizard.
That's a crocodile! A crocodile.

01:35:21.646 --> 01:35:22.730
Stay quiet.

01:35:26.688 --> 01:35:29.480
Adi, that small stone
can't kill the crocodile.

01:35:30.480 --> 01:35:32.313
This is for your <i>bhabhi,</i> you idiot.

01:35:32.605 --> 01:35:33.521
Okay.

01:35:34.646 --> 01:35:36.188
What happened?
Why are you throwing stones?

01:35:39.271 --> 01:35:40.146
What?

01:35:40.855 --> 01:35:41.855
What is it?

01:35:52.646 --> 01:35:53.521
Stay quiet.

01:35:54.980 --> 01:35:57.813
Quietly walk backward. Slowly.

01:35:58.105 --> 01:36:00.938
Come back slowly. Slowly.

01:36:01.396 --> 01:36:04.146
Absolute silence.
Don't make a sound.

01:36:11.688 --> 01:36:12.646
Adi, help!

01:36:13.646 --> 01:36:14.729
Adi, help!

01:36:14.730 --> 01:36:16.187
Adi, what do I do?

01:36:16.188 --> 01:36:19.187
Poke in its eye!
Hurry up, poke in its eye!

01:36:19.188 --> 01:36:20.646
- Okay… okay…
- Do it.

01:36:20.896 --> 01:36:23.645
You idiot, poke the crocodile's eye.

01:36:23.646 --> 01:36:24.771
Okay… okay…

01:36:27.813 --> 01:36:28.771
Hey, statue!

01:36:30.063 --> 01:36:31.145
Adi, it's not staying still.

01:36:31.146 --> 01:36:33.271
You've got a knife, right? Cut it!

01:36:33.396 --> 01:36:35.271
Cut it, come on.

01:36:35.605 --> 01:36:36.480
Yes.

01:36:37.521 --> 01:36:38.479
Adi!

01:36:38.480 --> 01:36:40.646
This won't be enough
to cut the crocodile.

01:36:40.855 --> 01:36:43.562
Idiot. Cut the bottle strap.
Come on.

01:36:43.563 --> 01:36:45.270
Come on.
Yes, come on.

01:36:45.271 --> 01:36:46.146
Come on, Manav.

01:36:46.271 --> 01:36:47.146
Yes.

01:36:48.271 --> 01:36:49.230
Oh my!

01:36:49.730 --> 01:36:51.396
Adi… Adi…

01:36:52.855 --> 01:36:53.938
Adi…

01:36:57.813 --> 01:36:59.396
Run, run, run!

01:37:11.146 --> 01:37:12.105
"M" is here.

01:37:12.355 --> 01:37:13.980
We've reached near "M".

01:37:14.563 --> 01:37:15.896
- Let's go.
- Come.

01:37:22.188 --> 01:37:23.105
Get down!

01:37:23.855 --> 01:37:24.730
Get down!

01:37:29.563 --> 01:37:30.438
Get up.

01:37:31.980 --> 01:37:34.063
Guddu, there could be danger inside.

01:37:34.605 --> 01:37:36.438
There’s no danger,
there's only treasure inside.

01:37:36.938 --> 01:37:38.730
Come on, hold each other's hands
and let's go.

01:37:46.563 --> 01:37:48.813
"M". M for money.

01:37:49.896 --> 01:37:51.021
M for…

01:37:52.813 --> 01:37:54.563
Look there. The way to go inside.

01:37:54.771 --> 01:37:55.729
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

01:37:55.730 --> 01:37:57.020
Adi, there could be danger inside.

01:37:57.021 --> 01:37:58.146
Just shut up.

01:37:58.396 --> 01:37:59.313
Okay.

01:38:03.146 --> 01:38:06.396
Paro, look there.

01:38:07.521 --> 01:38:08.438
"M" is here.

01:38:08.730 --> 01:38:09.605
Yeah!

01:38:09.855 --> 01:38:10.730
Hey.

01:38:12.563 --> 01:38:13.563
Look there.

01:38:16.105 --> 01:38:20.730
Let's go inside and find
a way to enter "O".

01:38:30.771 --> 01:38:33.771
Don't you find this place dangerous?

01:38:35.896 --> 01:38:37.605
What's there to be scared of?

01:38:37.813 --> 01:38:40.146
Just don't be scared.
Walk closely.

01:38:40.438 --> 01:38:41.313
Keep walking.

01:38:43.605 --> 01:38:47.313
Adi, this place looks
extremely dangerous.

01:38:48.271 --> 01:38:49.812
You think you'll find
Shaitaan Singh's treasure

01:38:49.813 --> 01:38:50.771
in a coffee shop?

01:38:52.396 --> 01:38:53.271
Found it.

01:38:57.271 --> 01:38:58.730
This must be the way
to get into the "O".

01:38:59.105 --> 01:39:00.230
- Yes! Yes!
- Come on. Let's go.

01:39:01.063 --> 01:39:01.938
Pull it, <i>bhabhi.</i>

01:39:13.813 --> 01:39:15.355
It's really quiet here.

01:39:23.396 --> 01:39:25.563
Listen, Paro. Don't flirt.

01:39:26.146 --> 01:39:27.520
I only let you hold my finger,

01:39:27.521 --> 01:39:29.396
and you've already got your whole hand
inside my shirt!

01:39:29.896 --> 01:39:31.313
Is this really the time to get romantic?

01:39:31.646 --> 01:39:33.395
I didn't do anything.

01:39:33.396 --> 01:39:35.605
Really? You didn't do anything?

01:39:36.021 --> 01:39:36.980
You didn't do anything, huh?

01:39:37.646 --> 01:39:38.521
Then…

01:39:39.521 --> 01:39:40.396
what is this?

01:39:40.688 --> 01:39:42.771
What is this? Tell me!

01:39:44.563 --> 01:39:46.146
You got scared looking at your own hand?

01:39:46.646 --> 01:39:49.313
That's not my hand. It's a snake!

01:39:51.063 --> 01:39:52.063
It's a snake?

01:39:52.521 --> 01:39:53.396
It's a…

01:39:55.438 --> 01:39:56.646
It really is a snake.

01:39:59.438 --> 01:40:01.230
Why is it flicking its tongue so much?

01:40:02.563 --> 01:40:04.896
He turned out to be a Casanova
among snakes.

01:40:05.480 --> 01:40:08.105
Listen, buddy, this is a family film.

01:40:08.438 --> 01:40:10.896
That stuff doesn't happen here.

01:40:12.938 --> 01:40:15.730
- Run! Run! Run!
- Run!

01:40:19.188 --> 01:40:20.063
Bro.

01:40:21.355 --> 01:40:22.271
Bro, stop.

01:40:22.938 --> 01:40:24.645
- It's too dark.
- I'm scared.

01:40:24.646 --> 01:40:27.480
My eyes have night vision.
I can see everything.

01:40:37.188 --> 01:40:39.063
We survived.

01:40:39.646 --> 01:40:40.563
We survived.

01:40:42.271 --> 01:40:43.229
Adi!

01:40:43.230 --> 01:40:44.938
- What happened?
- We won't survive!

01:41:07.730 --> 01:41:08.771
No… no… Don't move.

01:41:09.188 --> 01:41:10.730
Don't move. Don't move.

01:41:12.813 --> 01:41:13.938
Don't sneeze. No.

01:41:14.063 --> 01:41:15.105
Don't sneeze. Please, no.

01:41:15.438 --> 01:41:16.313
Don't sneeze.

01:41:16.438 --> 01:41:18.313
Thank you.

01:41:39.230 --> 01:41:41.688
Bro, we survived this time as well.

01:41:56.063 --> 01:41:57.063
You too have reached?

01:41:57.855 --> 01:42:00.020
Bro, he was the one who kicked.

01:42:00.021 --> 01:42:00.938
Damn, you…

01:42:06.021 --> 01:42:07.270
Oh shit!

01:42:07.271 --> 01:42:09.062
Help! Help!

01:42:09.063 --> 01:42:10.021
He has been crushed.

01:42:10.188 --> 01:42:12.230
- Help!
- I am here.

01:42:12.480 --> 01:42:14.812
Because you're here,
I need help. Get up, now.

01:42:14.813 --> 01:42:15.896
Yes, yes.

01:42:19.521 --> 01:42:20.771
So, you people made it here, too?

01:42:21.313 --> 01:42:22.438
Even this traitor showed up.

01:42:22.730 --> 01:42:23.646
Beat him up.

01:42:23.938 --> 01:42:26.230
- Beat him up.
- Hey…

01:42:28.271 --> 01:42:30.521
Don't you dare touch my husband!

01:42:30.938 --> 01:42:32.605
I will crush him right here.

01:42:32.938 --> 01:42:35.313
Madam, you don't know us.

01:42:35.563 --> 01:42:37.562
We are the dangerous villains.

01:42:37.563 --> 01:42:38.480
Right, Bro?

01:42:38.730 --> 01:42:40.313
You look more like a comedian.

01:42:41.563 --> 01:42:43.104
With one tight slap,
you will start saying,

01:42:43.105 --> 01:42:45.313
"Sister, I've never
seen someone like you."

01:42:45.438 --> 01:42:48.187
Listen, we don't raise our
hands on women. Understand?

01:42:48.188 --> 01:42:49.521
But I do raise my hand on men.

01:42:50.646 --> 01:42:51.730
Come on. Come forward.

01:42:51.855 --> 01:42:54.188
Adi, woman power.
Don't mess.

01:42:54.438 --> 01:42:56.980
Stop fighting and look for the "O".

01:42:57.146 --> 01:42:58.813
Good idea. Let's look
for the "O". Where's it?

01:42:59.105 --> 01:43:01.521
- "O".
- Yes, Bro, "O".

01:43:01.730 --> 01:43:03.895
- Find the "O".
- Where's the "O"?

01:43:03.896 --> 01:43:05.313
- Where's "O"?
- Look there.

01:43:05.771 --> 01:43:06.646
Where?

01:43:08.105 --> 01:43:09.105
Those are the skeletons.

01:43:09.230 --> 01:43:10.896
Does that mean people were
trapped and have died even here?

01:43:12.105 --> 01:43:14.270
That means we will also die
and get trapped here, Adi.

01:43:14.271 --> 01:43:15.687
Guddu! We don't want to die.
Please, save us.

01:43:15.688 --> 01:43:17.938
- Save me this time, Bro.
- Leave me.

01:43:18.980 --> 01:43:19.855
Wait!

01:43:21.146 --> 01:43:22.063
Seems so.

01:43:23.605 --> 01:43:25.521
There's no way out of this place.

01:43:27.271 --> 01:43:28.771
Damn, this Shaitan Singh!

01:43:30.438 --> 01:43:31.313
Guddu!

01:43:32.355 --> 01:43:33.812
Is your hand hollow?

01:43:33.813 --> 01:43:34.938
It’s sounding hollow.

01:43:35.230 --> 01:43:36.688
Idiot, this wall is hollow.

01:43:37.563 --> 01:43:39.438
If the wall is hollow,
let's break it.

01:43:40.396 --> 01:43:41.395
Stone! Stone!

01:43:41.396 --> 01:43:43.729
Yes, pick up the stone.

01:43:43.730 --> 01:43:45.855
Let's break it with stones.

01:44:09.646 --> 01:44:10.521
Bro!

01:44:11.980 --> 01:44:13.396
The treasure, Bro!

01:44:14.063 --> 01:44:15.021
Oh, damn!

01:44:18.396 --> 01:44:19.396
The treasure!

01:44:19.521 --> 01:44:21.188
- Let's get it, bro.
- Treasure.

01:44:36.480 --> 01:44:37.895
We found the treasure!

01:44:37.896 --> 01:44:39.020
Let's go. Let's go.

01:44:39.021 --> 01:44:42.604
- The treasure.
- Come on. Manav, let's grab it.

01:44:42.605 --> 01:44:43.480
Come on. Come on.

01:44:43.730 --> 01:44:45.521
- Treasure.
- Here. Here.

01:44:45.980 --> 01:44:48.021
So much money!
So much treasure!

01:44:49.480 --> 01:44:50.980
Let me grab it.

01:44:51.605 --> 01:44:53.896
We are the richest people now.

01:44:54.396 --> 01:44:56.813
Hereafter, my name is Johnny Gates.

01:44:57.563 --> 01:44:59.730
Manav, Rosy, find the diamonds.

01:45:01.563 --> 01:45:02.937
Diamonds. Diamonds.

01:45:02.938 --> 01:45:05.146
Hey, this is more
precious than the Kohinoor.

01:45:05.980 --> 01:45:08.438
We will dip these
biscuits in milk and eat.

01:45:08.563 --> 01:45:09.896
What are you waiting for?

01:45:10.063 --> 01:45:11.771
- Grab as much as you can.
- Yes.

01:45:11.980 --> 01:45:16.230
- Take these as well.
- Chocolate, PS5, pizza, we'll buy it all.

01:45:16.938 --> 01:45:18.230
Now, we've become wealthy.

01:45:18.355 --> 01:45:20.313
Mom won't have to work anymore.

01:45:20.480 --> 01:45:22.187
Grab as much as you can.

01:45:22.188 --> 01:45:23.355
Everything is for your mom.

01:45:23.896 --> 01:45:26.355
God! If only we could get a sack now.

01:45:26.480 --> 01:45:27.396
Excuse me!

01:45:27.938 --> 01:45:28.855
A sack.

01:45:29.105 --> 01:45:30.104
A girl by your side,

01:45:30.105 --> 01:45:31.687
and a sack in your hand.
You got lucky.

01:45:31.688 --> 01:45:34.146
- Thank you. Open the sack.
- Yes, yes.

01:45:34.438 --> 01:45:35.313
Hurry up.

01:45:36.480 --> 01:45:38.395
<i>- Bhabhi,</i> a sack.
- Thank you.

01:45:38.396 --> 01:45:40.313
May the evil eyes stay away.

01:45:41.230 --> 01:45:43.021
Santa Claus uncle, take this.

01:45:44.313 --> 01:45:45.355
Thank you, lollipop.

01:45:45.646 --> 01:45:46.688
From where did you get this sack?

01:45:46.980 --> 01:45:47.855
That uncle gave me.

01:45:56.063 --> 01:45:57.313
Hello, friends.

01:45:58.771 --> 01:46:00.563
- Adhoora, you?!
<i>- "Adhoora?"</i>

01:46:02.355 --> 01:46:03.521
But he seems complete.

01:46:03.646 --> 01:46:05.855
Adhoora is back.

01:46:08.105 --> 01:46:11.188
Grab it… grab the treasure for me.

01:46:11.563 --> 01:46:12.438
Come on. Come on.

01:46:13.313 --> 01:46:15.105
Why should we grab it out for you?

01:46:15.813 --> 01:46:18.062
And who are you, crooked walker?

01:46:18.063 --> 01:46:19.146
A finance minister?

01:46:21.230 --> 01:46:23.063
No. A defense minister.

01:46:23.771 --> 01:46:25.771
- Pirates, the gunner.
- Bro…

01:46:26.313 --> 01:46:28.396
Adhoora, how did you reach here?

01:46:34.271 --> 01:46:37.980
Am I putting on a show?
Why are you all clapping?

01:46:38.730 --> 01:46:39.896
Hey, come out.

01:46:45.396 --> 01:46:46.271
Prithvi, you?!

01:46:48.146 --> 01:46:49.188
Prithvi Deshpande?!

01:46:49.355 --> 01:46:50.230
Is he alive?

01:46:50.563 --> 01:46:51.896
This is cheating.

01:46:52.355 --> 01:46:55.437
Every time the one who tells
the secret to the treasure dies.

01:46:55.438 --> 01:46:57.063
The same thing happened
in the last three parts.

01:46:58.146 --> 01:46:59.021
How did you survive?

01:47:00.355 --> 01:47:01.230
I'll tell you.

01:47:01.730 --> 01:47:06.896
Behind the "O".

01:47:39.813 --> 01:47:42.146
Gun shooter G9.

01:47:43.813 --> 01:47:45.813
- Hello!
- Get lost!

01:47:48.980 --> 01:47:51.438
Alright, enough of your story now.

01:47:51.771 --> 01:47:53.480
Go stand in line with the others.

01:47:53.980 --> 01:47:56.312
- How come?
- Do as I say.

01:47:56.313 --> 01:47:58.146
But I'm on your team now.

01:47:58.563 --> 01:47:59.980
I brought you all here.

01:48:00.563 --> 01:48:01.438
Oh really?

01:48:01.688 --> 01:48:03.937
Now, I will send you up

01:48:03.938 --> 01:48:05.688
to the other world. Go there.

01:48:07.146 --> 01:48:09.521
You cheater. If I get
out of this place alive,

01:48:09.771 --> 01:48:11.312
I won't spare you. Hold this.

01:48:11.313 --> 01:48:12.188
Thank you.

01:48:13.938 --> 01:48:15.021
- Give it back!
- Hey!

01:48:15.896 --> 01:48:17.062
Make everyone stand in a line.

01:48:17.063 --> 01:48:18.937
- Everyone, stand in a line.
- Hurry up.

01:48:18.938 --> 01:48:20.437
- Come on. Come on.
- We're already in line.

01:48:20.438 --> 01:48:23.021
- In line. In line, move.
- Come on.

01:48:23.230 --> 01:48:24.230
Ready.

01:48:24.438 --> 01:48:26.146
They came here to loot the treasure.

01:48:31.313 --> 01:48:33.938
Now, whatever items
all of you've grabbed,

01:48:34.480 --> 01:48:36.146
- return everything. Jheenga.
- Yes.

01:48:37.813 --> 01:48:38.688
- Drop it.
- Come on.

01:48:41.563 --> 01:48:42.438
Take that out.

01:48:42.771 --> 01:48:43.980
Chocolates are gone.

01:48:44.105 --> 01:48:45.355
Pizza is gone.

01:48:45.688 --> 01:48:46.813
So is the burger.

01:48:47.313 --> 01:48:48.188
Keep it in here.

01:48:48.896 --> 01:48:49.813
Take it out.

01:48:52.938 --> 01:48:54.354
- Give it.
- I'm sorry. You can go ahead.

01:48:54.355 --> 01:48:55.355
Okay. Hey!

01:48:57.771 --> 01:49:00.396
Wanted to become rich
but turned into idiots.

01:49:00.688 --> 01:49:03.229
Wanted to become billionaires,
instead became beggars.

01:49:03.230 --> 01:49:05.313
You filthy fellow, go to hell!

01:49:08.105 --> 01:49:08.980
Put it back.

01:49:17.813 --> 01:49:19.980
Adi, give back the thing
you've put in your mouth.

01:49:21.355 --> 01:49:22.730
No, Adi. No violence.

01:49:24.313 --> 01:49:25.355
What is it?
Take it out.

01:49:28.063 --> 01:49:29.020
Take it out.

01:49:29.021 --> 01:49:29.896
How much time will you take?

01:49:34.896 --> 01:49:35.771
Hey…

01:49:44.563 --> 01:49:46.771
Take it out. Take it out, quickly.

01:49:47.021 --> 01:49:47.979
You will be cursed.

01:49:47.980 --> 01:49:48.855
No, I won't be.

01:49:51.896 --> 01:49:54.271
We don't use the incense sticks, okay?

01:49:54.688 --> 01:49:55.730
Keep this.

01:49:56.021 --> 01:49:57.355
- Hey, girl, take everything out.
- Come on. Take it out.

01:49:57.813 --> 01:49:58.730
Come on.

01:49:58.855 --> 01:50:01.271
<i>- Bhabhi's</i> bangles.
- May you be ruined!

01:50:01.813 --> 01:50:04.437
May your children
be born squint-eyed.

01:50:04.438 --> 01:50:05.855
- Like this?
- Here you go.

01:50:06.480 --> 01:50:09.021
May you never be at peace in life!

01:50:09.563 --> 01:50:10.688
- Take this, too.
- Wow!

01:50:10.980 --> 01:50:12.021
And what about the one in your wrist?

01:50:12.188 --> 01:50:13.355
That's my personal item.

01:50:13.646 --> 01:50:15.646
We are professional pirates.

01:50:15.813 --> 01:50:17.480
Robbers! Give it.

01:50:17.938 --> 01:50:19.396
Give it. Give it. Give it.

01:50:21.938 --> 01:50:23.062
Who would dare ask her?

01:50:23.063 --> 01:50:24.438
No problem, move ahead.

01:50:27.271 --> 01:50:28.146
Hey, hero!

01:50:29.605 --> 01:50:30.605
- Come on.
- Give away everything.

01:50:35.980 --> 01:50:37.230
Hey, return that.

01:50:40.855 --> 01:50:42.146
You seem very clever.

01:50:42.688 --> 01:50:43.813
Did you switch the sacks?

01:50:44.063 --> 01:50:45.021
What's in your mouth?

01:50:45.646 --> 01:50:46.604
What's in your mouth?

01:50:46.605 --> 01:50:48.188
Hey, what's in your mouth?

01:50:49.896 --> 01:50:50.938
Take it out.

01:50:51.855 --> 01:50:53.230
I said take it out.

01:50:57.271 --> 01:50:58.188
What is this?

01:50:59.271 --> 01:51:00.730
It's betel leaf spit, man.

01:51:01.521 --> 01:51:03.271
It's sweet. Want to taste it?

01:51:03.521 --> 01:51:05.646
Hey, this guy's crazy.
Completely mad.

01:51:06.313 --> 01:51:08.021
He's a psycho. An idiot…

01:51:09.646 --> 01:51:10.605
Yes…

01:51:11.563 --> 01:51:14.729
All this treasure, Jheenga…

01:51:14.730 --> 01:51:15.771
Now, it belongs to me.

01:51:15.938 --> 01:51:17.479
We won't let you take
this treasure away!

01:51:17.480 --> 01:51:19.313
- Hey.
- We won't let you…

01:51:19.688 --> 01:51:20.563
Don't move.

01:51:20.855 --> 01:51:22.230
Get ready to die!

01:51:22.521 --> 01:51:24.063
Kill all of them!

01:51:24.438 --> 01:51:25.396
Gunmen!

01:51:27.230 --> 01:51:28.355
Aim!

01:51:33.938 --> 01:51:34.938
Fire!

01:51:37.563 --> 01:51:38.480
What happened?

01:51:39.688 --> 01:51:40.563
How?

01:51:40.688 --> 01:51:41.646
Jheenga…

01:51:42.980 --> 01:51:43.938
…what happened?

01:51:45.105 --> 01:51:46.812
Boss, that ship had sunk
in the water, right?

01:51:46.813 --> 01:51:48.896
- Yes.
- So, water got inside the guns.

01:51:49.313 --> 01:51:50.813
We didn't have time to repair them.

01:51:51.146 --> 01:51:52.480
And we didn't find any
shop on the way, either.

01:51:52.730 --> 01:51:53.605
Jheenga, you…

01:51:53.730 --> 01:51:54.730
Hey!

01:51:55.355 --> 01:51:57.312
Stop! Stop!

01:51:57.313 --> 01:51:59.355
This is a very powerful bomb.

01:52:00.271 --> 01:52:02.020
- Step back.
- You can't do this.

01:52:02.021 --> 01:52:03.480
I will do it.

01:52:04.855 --> 01:52:07.563
And I'll do exactly this.
No one can stop me.

01:52:07.938 --> 01:52:09.562
- Boss!
- Yes, Jheenga!

01:52:09.563 --> 01:52:10.520
Fire!

01:52:10.521 --> 01:52:13.355
Of course I'll light it before
throwing the bomb at them.

01:52:13.730 --> 01:52:15.604
They'll be blown into pieces.

01:52:15.605 --> 01:52:17.145
Boss, we'll die, too.

01:52:17.146 --> 01:52:19.188
No way, Jheenga.

01:52:19.396 --> 01:52:22.104
I'll throw this bomb over there.
Those idiots will die.

01:52:22.105 --> 01:52:23.479
All of us will die.

01:52:23.480 --> 01:52:27.646
Look, Jheenga, look how they're
begging for their lives.

01:52:27.771 --> 01:52:28.729
Look there.

01:52:28.730 --> 01:52:31.605
Boss, we won't even
be left alive to beg.

01:52:31.730 --> 01:52:32.854
- Jheenga.
- Yes.

01:52:32.855 --> 01:52:34.938
Why do your eyes make it seem

01:52:35.105 --> 01:52:36.688
like I've already lit the bomb?

01:52:36.855 --> 01:52:37.813
Yes, you did.

01:52:38.188 --> 01:52:39.146
You idiot.

01:53:10.771 --> 01:53:12.396
Oh no. It's gone.

01:53:14.230 --> 01:53:15.105
Everything is gone.

01:53:21.105 --> 01:53:22.355
The treasure is gone!

01:53:22.855 --> 01:53:24.562
No, no! Don't go there.

01:53:24.563 --> 01:53:27.563
- The treasure…
- Adi, the treasure is gone.

01:53:30.355 --> 01:53:31.271
Treasure is lost.

01:53:31.563 --> 01:53:32.605
Everything is gone.

01:53:35.938 --> 01:53:36.813
Bro.

01:53:38.313 --> 01:53:39.271
Adhoora!

01:53:39.855 --> 01:53:41.563
- Tell me, Jheenga.
- What should I say?

01:53:41.896 --> 01:53:44.480
Your father gave you the right name.
Adhoora.

01:53:44.646 --> 01:53:46.480
You can never complete any task.

01:53:46.730 --> 01:53:48.770
You're bad luck even for yourself.

01:53:48.771 --> 01:53:52.355
Why don't you jump into
this pit and die, Adhoora?

01:53:53.855 --> 01:53:56.230
Idiot! First you burned the map,

01:53:56.771 --> 01:53:57.980
now you've destroyed
the treasure, too.

01:53:58.313 --> 01:53:59.230
I won't spare you.

01:54:04.855 --> 01:54:06.646
- Run!
- Run!

01:54:17.771 --> 01:54:19.646
This is breaking, bro.

01:54:23.480 --> 01:54:24.396
Oh shit.

01:54:25.438 --> 01:54:27.605
Mom! Mom!

01:54:36.896 --> 01:54:39.021
Move! Move! Run away.

01:54:39.146 --> 01:54:40.688
- Bro!
- Run! Move away!

01:54:45.105 --> 01:54:46.063
Come on. Come on.

01:54:47.646 --> 01:54:48.938
- Run, bro.
- Run, run!

01:54:49.730 --> 01:54:50.605
Run!

01:54:52.896 --> 01:54:55.063
- Come on!
- Hurry up.

01:55:03.313 --> 01:55:04.896
Oh no! Be careful.

01:55:06.355 --> 01:55:07.396
Be careful!

01:55:09.188 --> 01:55:11.021
Come on, kids!

01:55:11.313 --> 01:55:13.187
- Hello, Aaliya.
- Hi, Guddu!

01:55:13.188 --> 01:55:14.729
How's your bonding trip going?

01:55:14.730 --> 01:55:16.938
- Everything is falling apart.
- Give it to me.

01:55:17.230 --> 01:55:18.146
Hello, <i>bhabhi!</i>

01:55:18.771 --> 01:55:20.520
The climax is going on right now.

01:55:20.521 --> 01:55:21.480
Hang up for now.

01:55:21.646 --> 01:55:23.770
Otherwise, along with the hero,

01:55:23.771 --> 01:55:25.688
the supporting cast
will die too, <i>bhabhi!</i>

01:55:28.105 --> 01:55:29.271
Listen, Johnny…

01:55:33.355 --> 01:55:34.355
Careful, Paro!

01:55:47.188 --> 01:55:48.145
Let's jump.

01:55:48.146 --> 01:55:50.021
- Let's jump across.
- No, no…

01:55:50.605 --> 01:55:51.562
I can't do it.

01:55:51.563 --> 01:55:52.937
I won't be able to jump. No.

01:55:52.938 --> 01:55:54.229
You can do it. Come on, jump.

01:55:54.230 --> 01:55:55.688
No, I can't.

01:56:11.480 --> 01:56:12.355
Take this.

01:56:13.271 --> 01:56:14.396
These are the property documents.

01:56:16.563 --> 01:56:17.771
I've already put my thumbprint.

01:56:19.771 --> 01:56:21.188
You'll get 50 lakhs.

01:56:30.813 --> 01:56:31.896
I know…

01:56:33.480 --> 01:56:35.021
…you don't love me.

01:56:37.480 --> 01:56:38.813
I'm just a burden on you.

01:56:41.646 --> 01:56:42.605
So, go…

01:56:43.271 --> 01:56:45.813
Today, I free you from every bond.

01:57:03.313 --> 01:57:07.021
Maybe I'm a little greedy man…

01:57:11.021 --> 01:57:12.145
…but I'm not a coward

01:57:12.146 --> 01:57:13.438
to leave my wife in the

01:57:15.063 --> 01:57:16.355
jaws of death and run away.

01:57:19.521 --> 01:57:21.521
Now, I'll jump only with you.

01:57:22.688 --> 01:57:23.605
No, but…

01:57:23.980 --> 01:57:25.271
How will you carry me?

01:57:26.271 --> 01:57:28.271
When a person becomes
responsible, Paro,

01:57:29.438 --> 01:57:31.230
then no matter how heavy
the responsibility is,

01:57:32.230 --> 01:57:33.271
he carries it somehow.

01:57:35.730 --> 01:57:39.646
Lord Rama crossed the
ocean to save Goddess Sita.

01:57:41.438 --> 01:57:43.480
I also belong to the land of Lord Rama.

01:57:45.771 --> 01:57:47.313
So, can't I at least take

01:57:49.480 --> 01:57:51.146
this small jump to save you?

01:58:08.063 --> 01:58:10.021
Glory to Lord Rama!

01:58:56.313 --> 01:58:58.480
We survived!

01:58:58.980 --> 01:58:59.980
You survived…

01:59:00.688 --> 01:59:02.021
…but I got buried inside.

01:59:08.605 --> 01:59:09.521
Come on. Come on.

01:59:10.021 --> 01:59:11.980
Come fast. Run!

01:59:14.188 --> 01:59:15.770
- Come on.
<i>- Bhabhi!</i>

01:59:15.771 --> 01:59:16.938
Rosy, come fast.

01:59:27.355 --> 01:59:28.313
Oh shit!

01:59:29.188 --> 01:59:30.063
<i>Bhabhi!</i>

01:59:32.105 --> 01:59:34.146
Oh shit, <i>Bhabhi!</i>

01:59:38.688 --> 01:59:41.146
Manav! Manav, please save me.

01:59:41.313 --> 01:59:43.230
<i>Bhabhi,</i> don't panic.

01:59:43.730 --> 01:59:45.021
I'll save you.

01:59:45.771 --> 01:59:46.813
Don't worry.

01:59:48.021 --> 01:59:48.980
I'm there, <i>bhabhi.</i>

01:59:53.813 --> 01:59:56.355
Manav, let go of my hand,

01:59:56.480 --> 01:59:57.896
or you'll fall, too.

01:59:58.021 --> 01:59:58.938
No, <i>bhabhi.</i>

01:59:59.230 --> 02:00:00.188
No matter what happens,

02:00:00.938 --> 02:00:02.646
I won't let go of your hand.

02:00:03.896 --> 02:00:04.855
I won't leave.

02:00:05.188 --> 02:00:06.938
Manav, listen to me.

02:00:07.063 --> 02:00:07.980
No, <i>bhabhi.</i>

02:00:08.396 --> 02:00:09.563
Manav, leave me!

02:00:12.896 --> 02:00:14.313
You will also fall.

02:00:14.980 --> 02:00:15.980
Leave me.

02:00:16.271 --> 02:00:18.313
Mom, please help!

02:00:27.646 --> 02:00:30.771
Manav, don't let go of her.

02:00:32.188 --> 02:00:34.105
Pull up, Adi.

02:00:37.771 --> 02:00:39.980
- Manav, don't let go.
- I won't.

02:00:41.021 --> 02:00:42.813
- Come, bro. Come.
- Come on, kids.

02:00:43.313 --> 02:00:44.313
Come, bro.

02:00:44.730 --> 02:00:45.688
Run faster, kids!

02:00:48.146 --> 02:00:49.021
Aarav.

02:00:49.313 --> 02:00:52.104
Oh Bro!

02:00:52.105 --> 02:00:54.188
- Uncle Johnny!
- Stop!

02:00:58.438 --> 02:00:59.396
Uncle Johnny!

02:01:08.271 --> 02:01:09.146
Bro!

02:01:10.396 --> 02:01:11.480
Uncle Johnny survived!

02:01:11.730 --> 02:01:13.730
- Yes, he survived!
- Johnny Uncle!

02:01:14.605 --> 02:01:15.813
But how will we survive?

02:02:03.980 --> 02:02:06.563
Guddu… now it'll be difficult
for us to survive.

02:02:07.146 --> 02:02:10.396
Not until I'm alive!

02:02:10.605 --> 02:02:12.480
Guddu, please save us.

02:02:14.355 --> 02:02:16.063
Both of you will have to trust me.

02:02:17.271 --> 02:02:18.646
- Okay?
- Yes.

02:02:19.146 --> 02:02:20.021
Yes.

02:02:20.813 --> 02:02:21.771
Close your eyes.

02:02:23.563 --> 02:02:26.146
Johnny!

02:02:31.396 --> 02:02:32.855
Catch her.

02:02:52.855 --> 02:02:53.730
Are you okay?

02:02:54.313 --> 02:02:55.230
Thank you!

02:02:55.938 --> 02:02:56.813
Bro!

02:02:57.855 --> 02:03:00.938
- Come on, quickly.
- No, Guddu, no… No. I'll die.

02:03:02.063 --> 02:03:02.980
No, Guddu!

02:03:03.896 --> 02:03:05.771
Guddu, please!

02:03:06.355 --> 02:03:07.855
- Save me, please.
- Bro!

02:03:08.521 --> 02:03:09.896
Help me! Help me!

02:03:13.605 --> 02:03:15.062
Guddu, I don't want to die.

02:03:15.063 --> 02:03:16.480
Nothing will happen to you.

02:03:22.896 --> 02:03:24.438
- Save me.
- Careful!

02:03:25.396 --> 02:03:26.313
Come up, son.

02:03:29.355 --> 02:03:30.729
- Aarav.
- Bro!

02:03:30.730 --> 02:03:31.605
Guddu!

02:03:45.438 --> 02:03:47.063
What are you doing?
Come on.

02:03:47.396 --> 02:03:49.105
No, Guddu.
No, I can't do this.

02:03:49.355 --> 02:03:50.521
- I will die.
- Shut up.

02:03:51.646 --> 02:03:52.688
Nothing will happen to you.

02:03:54.021 --> 02:03:54.896
Trust me, please.

02:03:55.980 --> 02:03:56.855
Please, son.

02:03:57.396 --> 02:03:58.271
Come on.

02:04:04.563 --> 02:04:06.146
Come, my brave boy.

02:04:17.146 --> 02:04:18.021
Get up.

02:04:18.771 --> 02:04:19.646
Get up.

02:04:22.146 --> 02:04:24.188
Bro, you also come down now.

02:04:24.396 --> 02:04:25.313
Come, Guddu!

02:04:25.605 --> 02:04:26.480
Come on!

02:04:27.188 --> 02:04:28.521
- Bro!
- Guddu!

02:04:28.646 --> 02:04:29.521
Guddu!

02:04:30.730 --> 02:04:31.605
Guddu!

02:04:32.021 --> 02:04:34.230
- Bro!
- Guddu, careful!

02:04:34.771 --> 02:04:36.312
Come on!

02:04:36.313 --> 02:04:37.438
- Bro!
- Guddu!

02:04:38.313 --> 02:04:39.271
Guddu!

02:05:09.730 --> 02:05:11.438
Guddu!

02:05:15.146 --> 02:05:16.063
- Are you alright?
- Yes.

02:05:20.563 --> 02:05:23.271
I'll lose some weight, okay.

02:05:27.688 --> 02:05:28.605
Paro,

02:05:29.938 --> 02:05:32.021
you need not lose weight.

02:05:33.980 --> 02:05:37.146
I will let go of my greed.

02:05:40.563 --> 02:05:42.355
- I'm sorry, Paro.
- What are you doing?

02:05:43.146 --> 02:05:45.313
Don't do that.
You're my husband.

02:05:45.896 --> 02:05:47.105
You're like my God.

02:05:56.271 --> 02:05:57.230
Are you alright?

02:06:01.938 --> 02:06:03.020
Thank you, Manav.

02:06:03.021 --> 02:06:04.063
Welcome, <i>bhabhi.</i>

02:06:06.688 --> 02:06:07.605
Well,

02:06:08.438 --> 02:06:09.605
you had told me that

02:06:10.855 --> 02:06:13.105
before this trip ends,
I'll have to make a decision.

02:06:20.480 --> 02:06:21.646
My decision is that…

02:06:25.063 --> 02:06:26.480
I can't live without Manav.

02:06:30.313 --> 02:06:31.271
I'm sorry.

02:06:32.563 --> 02:06:34.188
Send me the divorce papers.
I'll sign them.

02:06:37.646 --> 02:06:38.563
Let's go, Manav.

02:06:38.813 --> 02:06:39.730
No, Adi,

02:06:41.271 --> 02:06:42.563
if we leave her behind,

02:06:42.980 --> 02:06:44.605
Mom won't be proud of us.

02:06:48.021 --> 02:06:48.980
Let's go, Manav.

02:06:49.688 --> 02:06:50.813
No, Adi, I won't go.

02:06:52.188 --> 02:06:53.145
Let's go, Manav.

02:06:53.146 --> 02:06:54.021
- No.
- Adi!

02:06:56.605 --> 02:06:57.563
I'm sorry.

02:06:58.980 --> 02:07:00.063
I'm really sorry.

02:07:02.230 --> 02:07:03.605
I've realized

02:07:04.813 --> 02:07:06.563
that family members
don't need to be perfect.

02:07:08.563 --> 02:07:09.938
They just need to have
love for each other.

02:07:15.480 --> 02:07:16.730
I'm sorry, Manav!

02:07:17.896 --> 02:07:20.646
<i>Bhabhi,</i> why are you apologizing?

02:07:21.563 --> 02:07:22.854
I should be the one apologizing.

02:07:22.855 --> 02:07:23.895
No… What are you doing?

02:07:23.896 --> 02:07:25.479
- Get up!
- Hey, man.

02:07:25.480 --> 02:07:26.438
Oh shit.

02:07:27.438 --> 02:07:29.521
What have you done?
You broke her nose.

02:07:30.771 --> 02:07:31.646
What?

02:07:31.896 --> 02:07:32.771
It's okay.

02:07:33.063 --> 02:07:34.020
Sorry.

02:07:34.021 --> 02:07:35.313
- It's okay.
- Sorry. Sorry.

02:07:39.230 --> 02:07:40.730
I'll get used to Manav.

02:07:42.771 --> 02:07:45.646
See, even <i>bhabhi</i> likes me.

02:07:45.938 --> 02:07:46.896
Yes.

02:07:49.980 --> 02:07:50.938
Let's go.

02:07:54.146 --> 02:07:57.646
Guddu sacrificed his life
to save you two.

02:07:59.730 --> 02:08:00.729
Had dad been alive,

02:08:00.730 --> 02:08:01.938
he too would've done
the same thing, right?

02:08:03.063 --> 02:08:07.396
Sister, our family has
become incomplete again.

02:08:12.021 --> 02:08:12.980
Yes, Aarav,

02:08:13.771 --> 02:08:15.605
once again we lost our father.

02:08:16.855 --> 02:08:19.105
Yes, sister. We lost him.

02:08:21.688 --> 02:08:23.021
What if he's still alive?

02:08:23.605 --> 02:08:26.688
Who would survive this fall?

02:08:27.521 --> 02:08:28.480
He can survive.

02:08:29.480 --> 02:08:30.688
Because he's Guddu.

02:08:31.313 --> 02:08:32.271
And not any weak fellow.

02:08:39.896 --> 02:08:40.938
Guddu!

02:08:52.563 --> 02:08:53.979
Guddu, I love you.

02:08:53.980 --> 02:08:55.313
Aarav, behave.

02:08:55.480 --> 02:08:56.396
Don't call him Guddu.

02:08:56.813 --> 02:08:58.313
- Call him dad.
- Yes.

02:08:59.188 --> 02:09:00.230
I love you all, too.

02:09:06.521 --> 02:09:09.021
The treasure was right in our hands, bro.
And now it's gone.

02:09:09.438 --> 02:09:11.355
No… I got two diamonds instead.

02:09:11.521 --> 02:09:13.188
- Where?
- Where are they? Show me.

02:09:13.855 --> 02:09:15.771
When a person finds his family,

02:09:17.230 --> 02:09:18.813
there's no treasure greater than that.

02:09:19.438 --> 02:09:20.730
I found these two precious diamonds.

02:09:21.188 --> 02:09:23.480
And we also found our hero.
That's you.

02:09:24.771 --> 02:09:25.896
So true, Guddu.

02:09:26.438 --> 02:09:28.563
I was also blindly running
after the treasure all my life.

02:09:29.063 --> 02:09:32.605
I never realized that the
real treasure is with me.

02:09:32.896 --> 02:09:33.771
Yes.

02:09:34.313 --> 02:09:36.605
The real treasure is always our family.

02:09:37.063 --> 02:09:38.020
Yes.

02:09:38.021 --> 02:09:39.521
My <i>bhabhi</i> is back.

02:09:39.771 --> 02:09:42.020
Adi is no longer a widower.

02:09:42.021 --> 02:09:44.520
Not a widower.
You can say I am still married.

02:09:44.521 --> 02:09:45.520
It's the same thing.

02:09:45.521 --> 02:09:46.562
Let's quickly go home now.

02:09:46.563 --> 02:09:48.105
I want to relish the parathas
made by <i>bhabhi.</i>

02:09:48.521 --> 02:09:50.313
- Let's go.
- But how do we go home?

02:09:50.771 --> 02:09:51.646
Yes.

02:09:52.896 --> 02:09:53.771
Look there.

02:09:59.646 --> 02:10:01.855
- That's a ship.
- Yes, a ship.

02:10:02.230 --> 02:10:03.688
We'll make it!

02:10:06.230 --> 02:10:07.313
We'll make it.

02:10:09.938 --> 02:10:10.938
Oh shit!

02:10:11.271 --> 02:10:13.105
- What happened?
- We're not safe. We're dead.

02:10:13.688 --> 02:10:14.813
Look whose ship it is.

02:10:19.896 --> 02:10:24.230
The incomplete man, bro!
Adhoora returns!

02:10:35.855 --> 02:10:36.771
Don't be scared.

02:10:37.605 --> 02:10:38.730
I'm not a villain anymore.

02:10:39.980 --> 02:10:45.646
I've come to understand that
the world loves heroes, not villains.

02:10:46.021 --> 02:10:50.105
Guddu saved my life. That's why
I've given up the pirate life.

02:10:50.688 --> 02:10:52.188
- That's great.
- Amazing!

02:10:53.105 --> 02:10:55.188
I'd heard that Munna Bhai
had given up his gangster life.

02:10:55.521 --> 02:10:57.646
This is the first time I've seen
someone give up the pirate life.

02:10:58.313 --> 02:10:59.563
- Wow!
- Also…

02:11:00.271 --> 02:11:03.230
from now on, this ship is my tourist boat.

02:11:04.063 --> 02:11:05.646
You guys are the first ones aboard.

02:11:05.938 --> 02:11:07.230
- Wow!
- Good!

02:11:07.355 --> 02:11:09.104
Adi, what do I do with this?

02:11:09.105 --> 02:11:10.146
Incense? Just throw it out.

02:11:10.896 --> 02:11:11.771
Stop!

02:11:22.480 --> 02:11:24.146
One more map, bro?

02:11:26.688 --> 02:11:28.980
This looks like a map to a huge treasure.

02:11:29.896 --> 02:11:31.063
Who's going to decode it?

02:11:31.188 --> 02:11:32.105
Hello!

02:11:34.730 --> 02:11:36.812
I will do it. Don't worry.

02:11:36.813 --> 02:11:37.730
You?!

02:11:38.063 --> 02:11:38.980
You are still alive?!

02:11:39.105 --> 02:11:39.980
Yeah.

02:11:40.146 --> 02:11:42.271
You've escaped death so many times,
you should've died of shame by now!

02:11:42.563 --> 02:11:44.355
What do I do?
I just don't feel any shame.

02:11:44.938 --> 02:11:46.105
I'll decode it. Yeah.

02:11:46.480 --> 02:11:47.480
Come on.

02:11:50.605 --> 02:11:51.480
Bring it here.

02:11:53.396 --> 02:11:54.271
Oh!

02:15:03.396 --> 02:15:04.355
CHATNI

02:15:21.271 --> 02:15:23.188
Roll camera and action!

02:15:29.313 --> 02:15:30.312
Hey!

02:15:30.313 --> 02:15:31.896
Adi, they are shooting something.

02:15:33.021 --> 02:15:34.313
How are they shooting without us?

02:15:34.438 --> 02:15:35.396
This is our song.

02:15:36.438 --> 02:15:37.396
- Yeah, come on.
- Let's go.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.688
They're shooting <i>Dhamaal</i> without us?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Hey…

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.729
Take it out. Take it out, quickly.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
You will be cursed.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
No, I won't be.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.896
We don't use the incense sticks, okay?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.563
Keep this.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.855
- Hey, girl, take everything out.
- Come on. Take it out.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
Come on.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.937
<i>- Bhabhi's</i> bangles.
- May you be ruined!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.145
May your children
be born squint-eyed.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.938
- Like this?
- Here you go.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.062
May you never be at peace in life!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.646
- Take this, too.
- Wow!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.562
And what about the one in your wrist?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.688
That's my personal item.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.521
We are professional pirates.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.188
Robbers! Give it.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.979
Give it. Give it. Give it.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.645
Who would dare ask her?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.896
No problem, move ahead.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Hey, hero!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.521
- Come on.
- Give away everything.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.771
Hey, return that.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.812
You seem very clever.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.646
Did you switch the sacks?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
What's in your mouth?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
What's in your mouth?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.104
Hey, what's in your mouth?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.563
Take it out.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.896
I said take it out.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
What is this?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.980
It's betel leaf spit, man.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.271
It's sweet. Want to taste it?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.646
Hey, this guy's crazy.
Completely mad.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.229
He's a psycho. An idiot…

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.480
Yes…

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.687
All this treasure, Jheenga…

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.562
Now, it belongs to me.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.062
We won't let you take
this treasure away!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.354
- Hey.
- We won't let you…

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Don't move.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.896
Get ready to die!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.063
Kill all of them!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
Gunmen!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.646
Aim!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.521
Fire!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
What happened?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
How?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
Jheenga…

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
…what happened?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.228
Boss, that ship had sunk
in the water, right?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.604
- Yes.
- So, water got inside the guns.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.021
We didn't have time to repair them.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.855
And we didn't find any
shop on the way, either.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Jheenga, you…

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.521
Hey!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.478
Stop! Stop!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.563
This is a very powerful bomb.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.270
- Step back.
- You can't do this.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.980
I will do it.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.229
And I'll do exactly this.
No one can stop me.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.145
- Boss!
- Yes, Jheenga!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.478
Fire!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.355
Of course I'll light it before
throwing the bomb at them.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.395
They'll be blown into pieces.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.061
Boss, we'll die, too.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.563
No way, Jheenga.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.229
I'll throw this bomb over there.
Those idiots will die.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.895
All of us will die.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:41.687
Look, Jheenga, look how they're
begging for their lives.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
Look there.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.396
Boss, we won't even
be left alive to beg.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.645
- Jheenga.
- Yes.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.604
Why do your eyes make it seem

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.104
like I've already lit the bomb?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
Yes, you did.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
You idiot.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.146
Oh no. It's gone.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Everything is gone.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.771
The treasure is gone!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.228
No, no! Don't go there.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.521
- The treasure…
- Adi, the treasure is gone.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.437
Treasure is lost.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.563
Everything is gone.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Bro.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
Adhoora!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.229
- Tell me, Jheenga.
- What should I say?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.105
Your father gave you the right name.
Adhoora.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.355
You can never complete any task.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.561
You're bad luck even for yourself.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:41.105
Why don't you jump into
this pit and die, Adhoora?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.896
Idiot! First you burned the map,

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.730
now you've destroyed
the treasure, too.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
I won't spare you.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.312
- Run!
- Run!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.396
This is breaking, bro.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.437
Oh shit.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.688
Mom! Mom!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.646
Move! Move! Run away.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.063
- Bro!
- Run! Move away!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
Come on. Come on.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.813
- Run, bro.
- Run, run!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Run!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.688
- Come on!
- Hurry up.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.104
Oh no! Be careful.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.562
Be careful!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.354
Come on, kids!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.395
- Hello, Aaliya.
- Hi, Guddu!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.062
How's your bonding trip going?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.729
- Everything is falling apart.
- Give it to me.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.437
Hello, <i>bhabhi!</i>

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.270
The climax is going on right now.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.480
Hang up for now.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.645
Otherwise, along with the hero,

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.438
the supporting cast
will die too, <i>bhabhi!</i>

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.687
Listen, Johnny…

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.521
Careful, Paro!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.478
Let's jump.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.396
- Let's jump across.
- No, no…

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.478
I can't do it.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.895
I won't be able to jump. No.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.812
You can do it. Come on, jump.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.979
No, I can't.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Take this.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.646
These are the property documents.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.729
I've already put my thumbprint.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.938
You'll get 50 lakhs.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.604
I know…

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.062
…you don't love me.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.854
I'm just a burden on you.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.480
So, go…

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.063
Today, I free you from every bond.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:41.229
Maybe I'm a little greedy man…

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.645
…but I'm not a coward

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.813
to leave my wife in the

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.813
jaws of death and run away.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.521
Now, I'll jump only with you.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
No, but…

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.812
How will you carry me?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.521
When a person becomes
responsible, Paro,

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.313
then no matter how heavy
the responsibility is,

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.562
he carries it somehow.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:41.437
Lord Rama crossed the
ocean to save Goddess Sita.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.563
I also belong to the land of Lord Rama.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.063
So, can't I at least take

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.187
this small jump to save you?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.479
Glory to Lord Rama!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.688
We survived!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.521
You survived…

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.854
…but I got buried inside.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.437
Come on. Come on.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.480
Come fast. Run!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.103
- Come on.
<i>- Bhabhi!</i>

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.688
Rosy, come fast.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
Oh shit!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
<i>Bhabhi!</i>

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.562
Oh shit, <i>Bhabhi!</i>

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.979
Manav! Manav, please save me.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.438
<i>Bhabhi,</i> don't panic.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.812
I'll save you.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.563
Don't worry.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.480
I'm there, <i>bhabhi.</i>

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.063
Manav, let go of my hand,

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.937
or you'll fall, too.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
No, <i>bhabhi.</i>

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
No matter what happens,

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.229
I won't let go of your hand.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.480
I won't leave.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.271
Manav, listen to me.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
No, <i>bhabhi.</i>

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.688
Manav, leave me!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.938
You will also fall.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.521
Leave me.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.563
Mom, please help!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.646
Manav, don't let go of her.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.438
Pull up, Adi.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.730
- Manav, don't let go.
- I won't.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.313
- Come, bro. Come.
- Come on, kids.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.521
Come, bro.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
Run faster, kids!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Aarav.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.312
Oh Bro!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.604
- Uncle Johnny!
- Stop!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
Uncle Johnny!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Bro!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.605
Uncle Johnny survived!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.521
- Yes, he survived!
- Johnny Uncle!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.729
But how will we survive?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.104
Guddu… now it'll be difficult
for us to survive.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.771
Not until I'm alive!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.396
Guddu, please save us.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.229
Both of you will have to trust me.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.896
- Okay?
- Yes.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Yes.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
Close your eyes.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.104
Johnny!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.980
Catch her.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Are you okay?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
Thank you!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Bro!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.604
- Come on, quickly.
- No, Guddu, no… No. I'll die.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
No, Guddu!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.396
Guddu, please!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.021
- Save me, please.
- Bro!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.896
Help me! Help me!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.978
Guddu, I don't want to die.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.938
Nothing will happen to you.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.063
- Save me.
- Careful!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
Come up, son.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.895
- Aarav.
- Bro!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Guddu!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.146
What are you doing?
Come on.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.230
No, Guddu.
No, I can't do this.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.687
- I will die.
- Shut up.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.563
Nothing will happen to you.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Trust me, please.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Please, son.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Come on.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.104
Come, my brave boy.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Get up.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Get up.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.563
Bro, you also come down now.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
Come, Guddu!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Come on!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.854
- Bro!
- Guddu!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Guddu!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Guddu!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.730
- Bro!
- Guddu, careful!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.062
Come on!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.646
- Bro!
- Guddu!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
Guddu!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.229
Guddu!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
- Are you alright?
- Yes.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.229
I'll lose some weight, okay.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
Paro,

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.604
you need not lose weight.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.687
I will let go of my greed.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.313
- I'm sorry, Paro.
- What are you doing?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.688
Don't do that.
You're my husband.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.730
You're like my God.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.480
Are you alright?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.603
Thank you, Manav.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.563
Welcome, <i>bhabhi.</i>

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
Well,

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.688
you had told me that

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.771
before this trip ends,
I'll have to make a decision.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.687
My decision is that…

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.938
I can't live without Manav.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
I'm sorry.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.146
Send me the divorce papers.
I'll sign them.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
Let's go, Manav.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
No, Adi,

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.813
if we leave her behind,

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.146
Mom won't be proud of us.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.480
Let's go, Manav.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.646
No, Adi, I won't go.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.478
Let's go, Manav.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
- No.
- Adi!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
I'm sorry.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.604
I'm really sorry.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.896
I've realized

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.271
that family members
don't need to be perfect.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.896
They just need to have
love for each other.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.771
I'm sorry, Manav!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.271
<i>Bhabhi,</i> why are you apologizing?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.812
I should be the one apologizing.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.561
No… What are you doing?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.104
- Get up!
- Hey, man.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
Oh shit.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.604
What have you done?
You broke her nose.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
What?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
It's okay.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.478
Sorry.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.813
- It's okay.
- Sorry. Sorry.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.021
I'll get used to Manav.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.396
See, even <i>bhabhi</i> likes me.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
Yes.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
Let's go.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:41.021
Guddu sacrificed his life
to save you two.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.520
Had dad been alive,

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.729
he too would've done
the same thing, right?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:41.854
Sister, our family has
become incomplete again.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.480
Yes, Aarav,

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.355
once again we lost our father.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.771
Yes, sister. We lost him.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.854
What if he's still alive?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.604
Who would survive this fall?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.480
He can survive.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.729
Because he's Guddu.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
And not any weak fellow.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.563
Guddu!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.937
Guddu, I love you.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.854
Aarav, behave.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.437
Don't call him Guddu.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.021
- Call him dad.
- Yes.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.563
I love you all, too.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.021
The treasure was right in our hands, bro.
And now it's gone.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.438
No… I got two diamonds instead.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.188
- Where?
- Where are they? Show me.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.437
When a person finds his family,

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.104
there's no treasure greater than that.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.813
I found these two precious diamonds.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.813
And we also found our hero.
That's you.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.646
So true, Guddu.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.646
I was also blindly running
after the treasure all my life.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:41.063
I never realized that the
real treasure is with me.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Yes.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.813
The real treasure is always our family.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.478
Yes.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.021
My <i>bhabhi</i> is back.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.770
Adi is no longer a widower.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.020
Not a widower.
You can say I am still married.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.520
It's the same thing.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.562
Let's quickly go home now.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.063
I want to relish the parathas
made by <i>bhabhi.</i>

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.313
- Let's go.
- But how do we go home?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Yes.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Look there.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.730
- That's a ship.
- Yes, a ship.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.979
We'll make it!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.604
We'll make it.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.521
Oh shit!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.355
- What happened?
- We're not safe. We're dead.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.646
Look whose ship it is.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:41.855
The incomplete man, bro!
Adhoora returns!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.437
Don't be scared.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.646
I'm not a villain anymore.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:43.187
I've come to understand that
the world loves heroes, not villains.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:41.605
Guddu saved my life. That's why
I've given up the pirate life.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.021
- That's great.
- Amazing!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.604
I'd heard that Munna Bhai
had given up his gangster life.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.646
This is the first time I've seen
someone give up the pirate life.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.771
- Wow!
- Also…

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:40.480
from now on, this ship is my tourist boat.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.104
You guys are the first ones aboard.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.813
- Wow!
- Good!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.270
Adi, what do I do with this?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.562
Incense? Just throw it out.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Stop!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.187
One more map, bro?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.813
This looks like a map to a huge treasure.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.688
Who's going to decode it?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
Hello!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.603
I will do it. Don't worry.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
You?!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.438
You are still alive?!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Yeah.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.646
You've escaped death so many times,
you should've died of shame by now!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.313
What do I do?
I just don't feel any shame.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.688
I'll decode it. Yeah.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.521
Come on.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Bring it here.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.396
Oh!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.480
CHATNI

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.438
Roll camera and action!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.520
Hey!

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:39.104
Adi, they are shooting something.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.813
How are they shooting without us?

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
This is our song.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.479
- Yeah, come on.
- Let's go.

02:15:37.521 --> 02:15:38.688
They're shooting <i>Dhamaal</i> without us?
